window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S02"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2,3],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","When the students have finished S1, they will continue to learn with S2.It is important to promote the young learners' motivation. You should know what they will study in S2 and design the class procedure. We hope that you can be an ideal teacher and let your students enjoy learning with you. So, this book will show you all the textbooks and lesson plans for S2. It is useful for your class. It also provides lots of teaching skills to improve yours. Read it, learn it and be an ideal English teacher!","学生学完 S1 之后，会继续学习 S2。提升小学习者的学习动机非常重要。您应该了解学生在 S2 会学到什么，并据此设计上课流程。我们希望您能成为理想的老师，让学生享受跟您一起学习的过程。因此，本书会呈现 S2 所有的课本和教案，对您的教学很有帮助，也提供许多教学技巧来提升您的教学。好好阅读、好好学习，成为一位理想的英语老师！",0],["h2","How To Teach S2","如何教 S2",0],["h3","● Teaching Materials Introduction","● 教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, which are S series (See It & Say It) and EEC series(Easy English Conversation), to help students learn English more confidently. Here are the teaching materials for S2 students:","本课程有两套系列：S 系列（See It & Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），帮助学生更有自信地学习英语。以下是 S2 学生使用的教材：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","● Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 2 Classroom Activities (2A)(2B) Homework Exercises (2A)(2B)","Classroom Readers 2、Classroom Activities（2A）（2B）、Homework Exercises（2A）（2B）",0],["h3","● Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","● VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises","S 系列 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","● Evaluation Volume","● 评估本（Evaluation Volume）",0],["p","Listening Labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets The S series, which have twelve levels, consist of five books: Classroom Readers 2, Classroom Activities 2A and 2B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 2A and 2B, (intended for home use). These sets have a three-month (24 sessions) time span in which to be completed. There are fifteen lessons, three Test Days, three Activity Days and three Review Days. This Teacher's Manual gives teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs teachers of the pace, grammar, communication and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include some types of game/exercise based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. before teaching Lesson 1 of the alphabet book. Methods of teaching the alphabet, phonics, classroom activities, songs and games are explained to supplement the lesson presentations, which follow.","听力练习（Listening Labs）、小测验（Quizzes）、测验（Tests）、活动单（Activity Sheets）。S 系列共有十二级，每级包含五本书：Classroom Readers 2、Classroom Activities 2A 和 2B（课堂上使用），以及 Homework Exercises 2A 和 2B（在家使用）。每套教材预计在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含十五课、三次测验日、三次活动日和三次复习日。本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师教学进度，以及语法、沟通和发音的目标。时间允许的话，每堂课都应加入一些以当天课程为主，或复习之前课程的游戏／练习。书中也说明了字母、自然拼读、课堂活动、歌曲和游戏的教学方法，作为后面各课教学的补充。",0],["h3","● Classroom Readers: C.R.","● Classroom Readers：C.R.",0],["p","This book contains dialogues, This book includes many roles to complete each dialogue. The students can listen and watch from the touchscreen all-in-one to understand the contents easily. In addition, the students can role-play with the characters in the touchscreen all-in-one; it is also a fun way to practice.","这本书收录对话，每段对话由许多角色完成。学生可以通过触控一体机聆听和观看，轻松了解内容；此外，学生也可以和触控一体机中的角色进行角色扮演，这也是很有趣的练习方式。",0],["h3","● Classroom Activities: C.A.","● Classroom Activities：C.A.",0],["p","There are two books for the Classroom Activities: 2A and 2B, which provide a variety of activities and exercises to strengthen conversation skills and reinforce sentence patterns. There is also a strong emphasis on phonetics and pronunciation to help students be good at spelling. If they are familiar with spelling, they can memorize vocabulary easily. With the exception of exercises or phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a workbook. The blank portions are necessary for the activities so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize Key Grammar/Sentence/Question Patterns.","Classroom Activities 共有两本：2A 和 2B，提供各种活动和练习，加强会话能力并巩固句型。本书也非常重视发音，帮助学生拼写拼得好；熟悉拼写的学生，就能轻松记住单词。除了练习题或发音活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导，用来激发英语沟通。它“不是”读本，也不是作业本。书中的空白部分是活动所需，目的是让学生用口语产出语言，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师用来强调重点语法／句型／问句句型的指引。",0],["h3","● Homework Exercises: H.E.","● Homework Exercises：H.E.",0],["p","Each student has 2A and 2B Homework Exercises, because teachers need a reasonable time to correct the homework. Hence, students can do one of the books while the teachers are correcting other one. Moreover, students have a great chance to practice what they have learned from school that day by doing the homework exercises, and also teachers can easily understand the students' learning results. It is different from S1 Homework Exercises. S2 has more spelling and sentence patterns practice. Teacher may preview the exercises at the end of class in order to let students do it smoothly.","每位学生都有 Homework Exercises 2A 和 2B 两本，因为老师需要合理的时间批改作业。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。此外，学生写作业时，有很好的机会练习当天在学校学到的内容，老师也能轻松了解学生的学习成果。S2 的作业和 S1 不同，有更多拼写和句型练习。老师可以在下课前先预习作业，让学生写得更顺利。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["li","● Teaching Syllabus/Today's Homework There are in total twenty-four times for the students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for helping students to fill out the forms of \"Teaching Syllabus\" and \"Today's Homework.\" Please write down the students progress in \"Teaching Syllabus.\" As to \"Today's Homework,\" please remind the students to do \"Homework Exercises\" and review the lesson by using VCD/ MP3 or go to our website:","● 教学进度／今日作业：学生和老师共有二十四次记录每堂课进度的机会。老师负责协助学生填写“教学进度”和“今日作业”表格。请在“教学进度”中写下学生的上课进度；在“今日作业”中，请提醒学生写 Homework Exercises，并用 VCD/MP3 或上我们的网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw. to review the lesson. These forms are located in the Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check each student's book after they finishad filling out the form, and record their performances.","www.jordan.com.tw 复习课程。这些表格都在每位学生的学习进度手册里。学生填写完表格后，请检查每位学生的手册，并记录他们的表现。",0],["h3","● Performance","● 学习表现",0],["p","Some specific learning item contents are listed in this area for the Teacher to check teaching points and for parents to know clearly what their kids have learned from the class. Put a tick in the square of \"Excellent,\" \"Good\" or \"Try Harder.\" according to their performance. \"Excellent\" means students understand all the contents and are able to use them; \"Good\" means students can almost understand what they learned in class but not good at performing; \"Try Harder\" means students need more help with the lesson, and have their parents pay more attention to their kids.","这一栏列出一些具体的学习内容，让老师检查教学重点，也让家长清楚知道孩子在课堂上学到了什么。依照学生的表现，在“Excellent（优秀）”、“Good（良好）”或“Try Harder（再加油）”的方格中打钩。“Excellent”表示学生了解所有内容并能运用；“Good”表示学生大致了解上课内容，但运用还不够熟练；“Try Harder”表示学生在这一课需要更多协助，也请家长多关心孩子。",0],["h3","● Teacher and Parent's Comments","● 老师与家长意见",0],["p","This is a section for Teacher and Parents to communicate with each other. Besides, Teacher may use this space for recording the date, time and lessons of making-up classes.","这是老师和家长互相沟通的栏。此外，老师也可以在这里记录补课的日期、时间和课程。",0],["h3","● Quiz Grade","● 小测验成绩",0],["p","Teacher may write quiz grades this space.","老师可以在这里写上小测验成绩。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheet","● 评估表",0],["p","There are in total three evaluation sheets, which should be recorded in Class 9, Class 16, and Class 24 for this term. These evaluation sheets , which are for students to evaluate themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the students have learned from the English course, and about their participation in class. Before they start to do it, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Example: Good Fair Try Harder","本学期共有三张评估表，分别在第 9 课、第 16 课和第 24 课填写。这些评估表是让学生自我评估用的，可以帮助家长了解孩子在英语课学到多少，以及上课的参与情况。开始填写前，请尽量清楚地说明表格内容。说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","The content of S1VCD/MP 3 is:","S2 VCD/MP3 的内容包括：",0],["h3","S Series","S 系列",0],["li","● Classroom Readers 2",null,0],["li","● Classroom Activities 2A, 2B","● Classroom Activities 2A、2B",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 2A, 2B","● Homework Exercises 2A、2B",0],["li","● EEC Book1 Lesson 7- Lesson 12 Teacher should introduce the new lesson or review the lesson which has been taught using the VCD/MP3. This will help students to be familiar with different learning experiences efficiently. Moreover, please encourage students to review or preview the lesson by listening to the VCD/MP3, and also on Jordan's Web Site.","● EEC Book 1 Lesson 7–Lesson 12。老师应使用 VCD/MP3 介绍新课或复习已教过的课程，这能帮助学生更有效率地熟悉不同的学习经验。此外，请鼓励学生听 VCD/MP3，并上乔登网站复习或预习课程。",0],["h2","Evaluation Volume","评估本",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/activity of your own that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores less than 80% on a test or quiz, he/she will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 80% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h3","● Spelling Quiz","● 拼写小测验",0],["p","Do spelling quiz about the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups, teacher can have students write down the words in the notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before doing it , Teacher may review the vocabulary which will be shown later on.","在热身时间针对之前教过的单词进行拼写小测验，老师可以请学生把单词写在笔记本或学习进度手册上。小测验前，老师可以先复习之后要考的单词。",0],["h3","● Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are in total three quizzes.They are in Class 6, Class 14 and Class 22 in this term. This is the preparation for the coming test. Students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to improve. And as well, teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 6 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。这是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会进步；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","● Listening Lab","● 听力练习（Listening Lab）",0],["p","There are three listening lab tests in this term, which are always on the formal quiz days in Class 6, Class 14 and Class","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在正式小测验日，也就是第 6 课、第 14 课和第",0],["li","22. It's a great chance to improve students' listening comprehension by using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty to understand the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and failed. Building their confidences is the most important mission.","22 课进行。这是运用听力练习录音带提升学生听力理解的好机会。测验时请留意学生的反应；如果他们听不懂题目，请再播放一次。不要让学生感到挫折或失败。建立他们的自信是最重要的任务。",0],["h3","● Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are totally three tests in Class7, Class 15 and Class 23 in this term. Teacher can see students' achievements from the tests. This is one of the most important standards for students whether they can promote to the highest level or not. As to oral evaluation, tape students' oral response while doing each oral test Teacher has to motivate students to speak out. Furthermore, Teacher may record some encouragement words to students and their parents, let them know the progress of students' oral performance.","本学期共有三次测验，分别在第 7 课、第 15 课和第 23 课。老师可以从测验看出学生的学习成果，这也是学生能否升上更高级别的最重要标准之一。口语评估部分，进行每次口语测验时要录下学生的口语回答，老师必须鼓励学生勇敢说出来。此外，老师也可以录一些鼓励的话给学生和家长，让他们知道学生口语表现的进步。",0],["h3","● Activity Sheet","● 活动单",0],["p","There are in total seven Activity Sheets in S2. Students may develop their abilities by doing interesting exercises, like filling in the blanks, drawing, and doing surveys with their classmates. All the activities are designed from Classroom Readers or Classroom Activities in order to let students not only easily get the picture of doing them but use what they have learned . Teacher should help","S2 共有七张活动单。学生可以通过有趣的练习发展能力，例如填空、画图，以及和同学做问卷调查。所有活动都是根据 Classroom Readers 或 Classroom Activities 设计，让学生不但容易理解怎么做，也能运用学过的内容。老师应协助",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[4,5],"b":[["p","students especially in pair or group work. Remind the students to take them home for parents so parents will know about their childrens' progress.","学生，特别是两人或分组活动时。提醒学生把活动单带回家给家长看，让家长了解孩子的进步。",0],["h2","EEC Series","EEC 系列",0],["h2","Easy English Conversation: EEC",null,0],["p","Text Book & MP3 (Book 1 Lesson 7- Lesson 12) Basically, there are six books in the EEC series. The idea of using these series with the S series is to enhance students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are useful and worthy conversation books. Easy English Conversation (EEC) Book One is focused on teaching children a very basic level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary and activities. The daily dialogues are designed to teach mannerisms and speech in a western style. EEC Book One contains three sections: Let's See and Say,","课本与 MP3（Book 1 Lesson 7–Lesson 12）。EEC 系列基本上共有六本，与 S 系列搭配使用的目的是加强学生的口语和听力能力，是非常实用又有价值的会话书。Easy English Conversation（EEC）Book One 着重于教孩子最基础的英语，每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话的设计是要教导西方的礼仪与说话方式。EEC Book One 包含三个部分：Let's See and Say、",0],["h3","Let's Check, and What Can I do?","Let's Check 和 What Can I Do?",0],["p","Each section has specific learning objectives.","每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","● Let's See And Say",null,0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture to let students know what they are going to learn from it. The picture presents the meaning of the situation, which will help them understand the roles and stories well. There are simple and short sentences in each dialogue. Teacher should explain a situation by showing the main picture and using a monologue to help students understand what kind of situation it is. For example:","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，让学生知道接下来要学什么。图片呈现情境的意思，能帮助学生了解角色和故事。每段对话都是简单的短句。老师应展示主图，并用一段独白说明情境，帮助学生了解这是什么样的情境。例如：",0],["p","What can you buy in the supermarket? Hmm. You can buy almost anthing in the supermarket. OK! Let's go shopping together. In addition, while teaching \"Let's Check\" and \"What Can I Do,\" Teacher also may introduce the situation using a monologue (an explanation) again, to help the students understand the dialogues well.","\"What can you buy in the supermarket? Hmm. You can buy almost anything in the supermarket. OK! Let's go shopping together.\" 此外，教“Let's Check”和“What Can I Do”时，老师也可以再用独白（说明）介绍一次情境，帮助学生更了解对话内容。",0],["h3","● Let's See And Say",null,0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture to let students know what they are going to learn. The picture presents the meaning of the situation, which will help them understand the roles and stories well. There are simple and short sentences in each dialogue. Teachers should explain a situation by showing the main picture to help students understand what kind of situation it is.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，让学生知道接下来要学什么。图片呈现情境的意思，能帮助学生了解角色和故事。每段对话都是简单的短句。老师应展示主图说明情境，帮助学生了解这是什么样的情境。",0],["h3","● Let's Check",null,0],["p","In this section, there are listening comprehension and writing activities for students to practice, which are designed to show what students have learned from the unit. The listening comprehension exercise is for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of each unit .The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary.","这个部分有听力理解和书写活动让学生练习，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力理解练习用来复习每个单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","● What Can I Do?",null,0],["p","This section is the student's self evaluation . Before the end of the class, teachers should tell the students to open their books and to finish this evaluation. First , teachers should read each item for students and explain the meaning. After finishing the explanation, students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Also they can explain the meaning of the list to their parents at home . Example: Good fair Try Harder","这个部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应请学生打开课本完成这份评估。老师先逐项念给学生听并解释意思，说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。学生回家后也可以向家长解释清单的意思。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● Phonics","● 自然拼读",0],["p","The students have learned phonics in S1 while they were learning the alphabet. The rest of this series will focus on teaching the students how to pronounce a word using phonetic conepts. Teacher may refer to \"Phonics Summaries\" at the bottom of this manual to know what phonics you are going to teach in S2. In addition, please be sure of the sounds by listening to the MP3.","学生在 S1 学字母时已经学过自然拼读。这个系列接下来会着重教学生运用发音概念念出单词。老师可以参考本手册最后的“发音总整理”，了解 S2 要教哪些发音。此外，请听 MP3 确认发音正确。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","To form a good habit of memorizing vocabulary, try to teach spelling at the beginning of the classes. Students have learned the alphabet in S1. So learning spelling in S2 should be easy. Ask the students to practice spelling the new words at home. Call out individual student to spell the review words as you take attendance. A good method to teach it is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","为了养成记单词的好习惯，请在上课一开始就教拼写。学生在 S1 已经学过字母，所以在 S2 学拼写应该不难。请学生在家练习拼新单词。点名时，请个别学生拼复习的单词。一个好方法是：“每次”介绍新单词时，都依照以下步骤进行：",0],["p","1.Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times. 2.Write the word on the board and divide the word syllable by syllable. Introduce it phonetically. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word this way, then start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the student rather than calling them by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵，重复几次。2. 把单词写在黑板上，按音节拆开，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching for S2","● S2 综合教学法",0],["li","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response) Teacher gives the commands and the students follow. Those commands are all from Classroom Language. For example: Open your book. Raise your hand., or \"Point to kite/giraffe/friend/\" etc. 2.V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept) The best way to help the students to understand the meaning of English is to use pictures, flashcards, objects, and other tools to teach in class, ex: Digital Teaching. These teaching methods will heighten students' interests in English learning.","1. T.P.R.（全肢体反应教学法）：老师下指令，学生照着做。这些指令都来自课堂用语，例如：Open your book. Raise your hand. 或 \"Point to kite/giraffe/friend\" 等。2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）：帮助学生了解英语意思的最好方法，就是在课堂上用图片、单词卡、实物和其他教具教学，例如数字教学。这些教学方法能提高学生学英语的兴趣。",0],["h3","3.Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","This is a common way for teaching in class, but it's very useful. Have the students repeat afrer the Teacher several times until they are familiar with saying the vocabulary or the sentences.","这是课堂上常见的教学方式，但非常有用。请学生跟着老师复诵数次，直到他们能熟练地说出单词或句子。",0],["d","This is a slide.","T",0],["d","This is a slide.","Ss",0],["d","It is a doll. It is a doll.","T",0],["d","It is a doll. It is a doll.","Ss",0],["d","It is a yo-yo. It is a yo-yo. It is a yo-yo. (or three times)","T",0],["d","It is a yo-yo. It is a yo-yo. It is a yo-yo.","Ss",0],["h3","4.Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have the students practice the certain sentence pattern in turns. For example:","让学生轮流练习某个句型。例如：",0],["d","How old are you?","S1",0],["d","I am ______. How old are you?","S2",0],["d",":I am ______. ( And continue the drill until all the students have done it)","S3",0],["h3","5.Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","There are varied ways to play with a ball for practicing English. Here is one of the ways:","用球练习英语有很多种玩法，以下是其中一种：",0],["p","Teacher throws a ball to the first student and asks him a question. He answers the question right away and then throws the ball back to the teacher or to the next student.","老师把球丢给第一位学生并问他一个问题，他马上回答后，再把球丢回给老师或传给下一位学生。",0],["d","Are you a boy? (throws the ball to S1)","T",0],["d","Yes, I am a boy./No, I am a girl. (S1 throw the ball to S2)","S1",0],["h3","6.Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","There are varied ways to play Chart Drill for practicing English in the Teacher's Manual. Here is one of the ways below:","教师手册中有许多用图表练习英语的玩法，以下是其中一种：",0],["d","(put a magnet on one of the square and have a student make a sentence)","T",0],["d","This is a rule","S1",0],["h3","7.Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write a sentence pattern on the board. For example:","在黑板上写一个句型。例如：",0],["p","They are .",null,0],["d","(show one of the flashcards and have S1 finish the complete sentence) (\"hamburgers\")","T",0],["d","They are hamburgers.","S1",0],["h3","8.Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["p","Pair students up and have them be characters to practice the dialogue or conversation in the front. 9.Cloze Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have students fill in the blanks.","让学生两两一组扮演角色，到台前练习对话。9. 克漏字：把句子中的一些关键字去掉，请学生填空。",0],["h3","10.Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","The best time to do \"Question & Answer\" is at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. Teacher asks the questions from the previous lessons to enhance tudents' learning results.","进行“问与答”最好的时机是每堂课开始的 5–10 分钟。老师问之前课程的问题，加强学生的学习成果。",0],["h3","11.Expansion Drill","11. 扩展练习",0],["p","It is an effective way to practice English. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。例如：",0],["p","Have students sit around a circle and start this drill.","请学生围成一圈坐好，开始这个练习。",0],["d","I am a teacher.","S1",0],["d","He is a teacher. I am a student.","S2",0],["d","He is a teacher. She is a student. I am a bus driver.","S3",0],["p","(Continue this drill until all the students have done it)","（持续进行，直到所有学生都练习过）",0],["h3","12.Transformation","12. 句型转换",0],["p","Teacher writes down a sentence, such as \"It is a drum.\" Now have one of the students change the sentence into another form: It is not a drum. This is a useful way to practice grammar and sentence structures.","老师写下一个句子，例如 \"It is a drum.\"，请一位学生把句子换成另一种形式：\"It is not a drum.\" 这是练习语法和句子结构的好方法。",0],["h3","13.Situational Practice","13. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the contents of the lessons to help the students understand the meaning of English exactly and also enjoy learning English.","依照课程内容设计各种情境，帮助学生确实了解英语的意思，也享受学英语的乐趣。",0],["h3","●Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All the contents of S2 are on Jordan's website, which includes Classroom Readers, Classroom Activities, and Easy English Conversation Book 1. Students will have a lot of fun in learning English by watching and practicing animated pictures from this website. And Teacher can teach well through this fashionable and interesting teaching idea. The teaching steps of digital teaching are found in the Teacher's Manual for each class. And also, please encourage students to practice English using this website on the touchscreen all-in-one in class as well as at home. Previews, Assist, Review are the three important factors for teachers, students and parents while they make use of it. It is a high-technology multimedia, but it is easy to operate.","S2 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities 和 Easy English Conversation Book 1。学生通过观看和练习网站上的动画，能非常愉快地学英语；老师也能通过这种新颖有趣的教学方式把课教好。每堂课的数字教学步骤都写在教师手册中。也请鼓励学生在课堂上和在家用触控一体机上这个网站练习英语。预习、辅助、复习是老师、学生和家长使用时的三大重点。这是高科技的多媒体教材，但操作很简单。",0],["h3","●How to Visit Jordan's Website","● 如何使用乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ↓ 乔登美语教学网 ↓ e-Learning ↓ e-Learning白金会员 ↓ Enter the password ↓ Big Kid 大儿童学习区 ↓ Lesson IV儿童进阶 ↓ Book2","www.jordan.com.tw ↓ 乔登美语教学网 ↓ e-Learning ↓ e-Learning 白金会员 ↓ 输入密码 ↓ 大儿童学习区 Big Kid ↓ 儿童进阶 Lesson IV ↓ Book 2",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[6,7],"b":[["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["h3","1. Commands","1. 指令",0],["p","Please repeat after me. Please make a sentence. Please make a question out of this sentence. Listen to me carefully. Let's take a break for ten minute. Let's take turns. Go back to your seats. Put all of your things away.",null,0],["h3","2. Interation","2. 互动鼓励语",0],["p","When interacting with the students, it is important to offer positive reenforcement in a constructive manner that makes them feel good about what they have achieved and encourages their future efforts. Good job! Nice try! Excellent! Terrific! Wonderful! Way to go! Good for you! Well done! Good for you! I know you could do it! Oh.... Yes! You can do it! I know you can! Go ahead! Give it a try! Give it your best. You'll never know if you don't try! Go! Go! Go! You'll get it next time! That's the way it goes sometimes. You're still great! Next time, OK? Keep on keeping on! Oh, well. Keep on trying!","和学生互动时，以建设性的方式给予正面鼓励非常重要，让他们对自己的成就感到开心，也鼓励他们继续努力。Good job! Nice try! Excellent! Terrific! Wonderful! Way to go! Good for you! Well done! I know you could do it! Oh... Yes! You can do it! I know you can! Go ahead! Give it a try! Give it your best. You'll never know if you don't try! Go! Go! Go! You'll get it next time! That's the way it goes sometimes. You're still great! Next time, OK? Keep on keeping on! Oh, well. Keep on trying!",0],["h2","How To Manage","班级管理",0],["h3","Class Preparation","课前准备",0],["li","(1) Please arrive at School thirty minutes early to do class preparation.","(1) 请提早三十分钟到学校做课前准备。",0],["li","-Fill out Teacher's Handbook","- 填写教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）",0],["li","-Prepare Teaching Materials","- 准备教材",0],["li","-Log on to Jordan's Website and get familiar with today's lesson by operating the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 登录乔登网站，操作触控一体机熟悉今天的课程。",0],["li","-Help the students who wer absent make up the missing class","- 协助缺席的学生补课。",0],["li","(2) Please go into the classroom five minutes earlier to get everything done, and also interact with students.","(2) 请提早五分钟进教室把一切准备好，并和学生互动。",0],["li","-Check the touchscreen all-in-one is ready for the coming class.","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。",0],["h2","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","The Teacher should maintain proper discipline at all times. Swearing, spitting, throwing objects, standing on chairs/desks, hitting others, kicking walls, etc... are prohibited. Eating and drinking during class time will be left up to the individual schools/teachers, but these actions should be discouraged. A simple, common sense approach to discipline is usually best.","老师应随时维持良好的课堂秩序。禁止骂脏话、吐口水、丢东西、站在椅子／桌子上、打人、踢墙壁等行为。上课时间是否可以吃喝由各分校／老师决定，但应尽量避免。简单、合乎常理的管理方式通常最好。",0],["h3","Discipline involves keeping everyone happy. Even the","秩序管理是要让每个人都开心，即使是",0],["p","students who are disciplined should end up happy. The student should understand that it is not them the teacher is unhappy with, just their behaviors. Discipline should never be a personal criticism. The student should know that the Teacher likes them, but only wants their behaviors to be improved. Some basic things to remember about classroom behaviors:","被管教的学生，最后也应该开心。学生应该明白，老师不高兴的不是他这个人，而是他的行为。管教绝不应是对人的批评；学生应该知道老师喜欢他，只是希望他的行为能改进。关于课堂行为，有几点基本原则要记住：",0],["li","-A misbehaving class is usually a bored class. A quick pace will help to ensure the students maintain attention.","- 秩序不好的班级通常是无聊的班级。快速的节奏有助于让学生保持专注。",0],["li","-Have your teaching aids and materials at hand to avoid lengthy delays, which give the students the opportunity to start misbehaving.","- 把教具和教材准备在手边，避免拖延太久，让学生有机会开始捣蛋。",0],["li","-Call on the students in a random order. If a student doesn't know when it is his/her turn they will pay closer attention.","- 随机点学生。如果学生不知道什么时候轮到自己，就会更专心。",0],["li","-Mix choral work with pair work and individual practice. If possible, switch from one type of practice to another often to help keep interest and variety. Finally, return to group work to follow-up/reinforce the lesson. Minimize individual work if time is short. If a student is creating a problem in class, give him/her a long stare or a tap on the shoulder to let them know you disapprove. If the student persists, tell him/her to stop the disruptive behavior. If the problem continues, take away reward cards or have him/her stand up. Finally, if the student won't stop, send him/her out of the classroom to see the secretary. The student's parents should be notified of the behavior. You should treat the students well after each of these steps. You must show the individual that you are still friends, but you don't approve of their actions.","- 全班齐声练习、两人练习和个别练习交替进行。可能的话，经常变换练习方式，保持新鲜感和变化。最后回到全班练习，延伸／巩固本课内容。时间不够时，尽量减少个别练习。如果有学生在课堂上制造问题，先盯着他看久一点，或拍拍他的肩膀，让他知道您不认同。如果学生仍然继续，请他停止干扰行为。问题若持续，就收回奖励卡或请他站起来。最后，如果学生还是不停止，请他到教室外找行政人员，并通知家长学生的行为。每一步之后都要好好对待这位学生，让他知道你们还是朋友，只是您不认同他的行为。",0],["h3","●New Students in Your Class","● 班上的新同学",0],["p","There are always new students transferring to the class. NO matter they are from other classes or schools, the Teacher should help them adapt themselves to the environment, following are some tips:","班上总会有转进来的新同学。不论他们来自其他班级或学校，老师都应该帮助他们适应环境。以下是一些建议：",0],["li","-Introduce them to the class.","- 向全班介绍新同学。",0],["li","-Help them make up the lessons until they can catch up the progress.","- 帮助他们补课，直到跟上进度。",0],["li","-Pay attention to their learning attitude and help them solve the problems immediately.","- 留意他们的学习态度，并立即协助解决问题。",0],["h3","● Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts and without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully, this is a very important process for the beginners. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly.","从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。",0],["h3","Here are some tips for helping the beginners doing","以下是帮助初学者",0],["h3","homework successfully ","顺利完成作业的一些秘诀：",0],["p","1.Make full use of \"reinforcement\" section of lesson plan in each class. Have students open the Homework Exercises to preview all the items about today's lesson. 2.Make a clear explanation for them to understand the content of today's Homework Exercises. And ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT (Foreign Teacher) and the CT (Chinese Teacher). A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using the A-B-C system (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","1. 充分利用每堂课教案中的“Reinforcement（加强复习）”部分，请学生打开 Homework Exercises，预习今天课程的所有题目。2. 清楚说明今天 Homework Exercises 的内容，让学生了解，并请他们先练习几题，确认他们都懂了。外籍老师（FT）和中籍老师（CT）批改作业和测验的标准要一致。批改作业有个好用的原则：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果您用 A-B-C 等第制，请依照以下方式把分数换算成等第：",0],["p","90-100 A 80-90 B 70-80 C 60-70 D",null,0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed Telephone Teaching Material (TTM) to help students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should grade students responses using letter grades (A B C or D). Write comments in the \"Teacher's Handbook\", and, for encouragement, give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. For doing well on telephone teaching, the teacher may lead students to prepare those questions in class and give students 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. In addition, while doing Telephone Teaching, be sure to greet students at the beginning of a conversation and give students some encouragement after they answer each question. Procedures:","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应用等第（A、B、C 或 D）为学生的回答评分，把评语写在“教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）”中，并在下次上课时依照表现给予奖励卡作为鼓励。为了让电话教学顺利，老师可以在课堂上带学生准备这些问题，每题给学生 2 到 3 次回答机会。此外，进行电话教学时，对话开始时一定要先问候学生，学生每回答一题后也要给予鼓励。步骤：",0],["p","1.Greetings: Say hello to students or their family. Let them know you want to talk to the student. Suggestions:","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。建议用语：",0],["li","(1) Good afternoon.(Good evening)",null,0],["li","(2) Hello! _____.(Student's name), this is______. (Teacher's name). How are you today? 2.Questions and Answers: Try to encourage students to answer with complete sentences. Suggestions:","(2) Hello! ___ (Student's name), this is ___ (Teacher's name). How are you today? 2. 问与答：尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。建议用语：",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl! 3.Ending: Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if needed:","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl! 3. 结尾：再次鼓励学生，需要的话提醒他们一些事情：",0],["p","Suggestions:","建议用语：",0],["li","(1) You are very good. Please finish your homework.",null,0],["li","(2) Don't forget to let your parent sign the \"Progress Report Book.\"",null,0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for the quiz/test next class?",null,0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, thank you.",null,0],["li","(5) How was school today?",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[8],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[9],"b":[["h2","S2 Learning Goals","S2 学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. To recognize single and plural nouns and answer the question of \"How many.\"","1. 认识单数和复数名词，并能回答 \"How many\" 的问题。",0],["li","2. To recognize the usage of adjective.","2. 认识形容词的用法。",0],["li","3. Capable to use the connective \"and.\"","3. 能使用连词 \"and\"。",0],["li","4. Capable to use single and plural pronouns. For example :He ...,They... and so on.","4. 能使用单数和复数代词，例如：He...、They... 等。",0],["li","5. Capable to recognize contraction. For example: That's ,I'm , and so on.","5. 能认识缩写，例如：That's、I'm 等。",0],["li","6. Review the usage of :\"Be\" verb, positive sentences, negative sentences and question.","6. 复习 Be 动词的用法：肯定句、否定句和问句。",0],["li","7. Review single and plural program.","7. 复习单数和复数。",0],["li","8. Capable to use the adverb \"too.\"","8. 能使用副词 \"too\"。",0],["h2","B) Communicative Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. Capable to use simple adjective to describe oneself or someone else.","1. 能用简单的形容词描述自己或别人。",0],["li","2. Capable to describe things with colors.","2. 能用颜色描述东西。",0],["li","3. Capable to recognize occupations and transportations.","3. 能认识职业和交通工具。",0],["li","4. Can speak 100 new vocabulary.","4. 能说出 100 个新单词。",0],["li","5. Capable to describe nationality and gender by oneself or someone else.","5. 能说出自己或别人的国籍和性别。",0],["li","6. Capable to use conditional adjective to describe oneself and someone else. For example:","6. 能用表示状态的形容词描述自己和别人。例如：",0],["p","He is hungry.",null,0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: many, rulers, books, erasers, pens, pencils Class 2: look, kite, yellow, blue, red, green, black, white, brown Class 3: big, small, dirty, clean Class 4: tall, short, fat, thin, giraffe Class 5: they, hamburgers, popsicles Class 9: we, happy, friends, good, angry Class 11: hello, new, game Class 12: school, man woman, baby, Mr. Mrs. Miss Class 13: see-saw, slide, bell, ball, toy, kite, doll, yo-yo Class 17: classroom, too, drum, piano, flute, violin Class 18: driver, library, office, desk, chair, picture, clock, my Class 19: Chinese, eleven, American, Japanese, Mexican Class 20: classmate(s), happy, meet, hungry, thirsty, hot, cold, full Class 21: test, ready, hurry up, sorry, old, young, angry, sad, bad","第 1 课：many, rulers, books, erasers, pens, pencils　第 2 课：look, kite, yellow, blue, red, green, black, white, brown　第 3 课：big, small, dirty, clean　第 4 课：tall, short, fat, thin, giraffe　第 5 课：they, hamburgers, popsicles　第 9 课：we, happy, friends, good, angry　第 11 课：hello, new, game　第 12 课：school, man, woman, baby, Mr., Mrs., Miss　第 13 课：see-saw, slide, bell, ball, toy, kite, doll, yo-yo　第 17 课：classroom, too, drum, piano, flute, violin　第 18 课：driver, library, office, desk, chair, picture, clock, my　第 19 课：Chinese, eleven, American, Japanese, Mexican　第 20 课：classmate(s), happy, meet, hungry, thirsty, hot, cold, full　第 21 课：test, ready, hurry up, sorry, old, young, angry, sad, bad",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[10,11,12,13],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To ask and answer questions using \"How many ?\"","能用 \"How many ___?\" 问答。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Offering to help","- 主动提供帮忙",1],["li","-Accepting offers","- 接受别人的帮忙",1],["li","-Expressing appreciation","- 表达感谢",1],["li","-Responding to expressions of gratitude","- 回应别人的感谢",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","1-10 number flashcards, vocabulary flashcard, the digital equipment","1–10 数字单词卡、单词单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A Lesson1","Classroom Activities 2A 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","many, rulers, erasers, pens, books, pencils",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","How many....? I can count ......",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Hard c","硬 c",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 7","EEC 1 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","banana, watermelon, papaya, guava",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Need a hand?","A",1],["d","Yes, please.","B",1],["p","Thanks a lot.",null,1],["d","Don't mention it","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Review conversation that they have learned in S1.","1. 复习在 S1 学过的对话。",0],["d","How are you?","T",0],["d","I am fine.","S",0],["d","What is your name?","T",0],["d","My name is _____.","S",0],["li","2. Review the numbers 1-10. Sing the \"Ten Little Indians\" song. Get them to sing this forward and backward.","2. 复习数字 1–10。唱“Ten Little Indians”，让学生顺着唱、再倒着唱。",0],["li","3. Write the numbers randomly on the board. Divide the class into teams. Call them to the board, yell out the numbers and see who hits the correct number first.","3. 在黑板上随机写数字，把全班分成几队。请学生到黑板前，老师大声喊出数字，看谁先拍到正确的数字。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 1 In the Book Shop","Classroom Activities（35 mins）第 1 课 In the Book Shop 在书店",0],["h3","Learning","学习（Learning）",0],["p","First, show the new sentences, which will be taught today using the monitor. Then, keep teaching using those sentences.","先用屏幕展示今天要教的新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。",0],["h3","(1) Enter the \"Learning\" page","(1) 进入“Learning”页面",0],["p","After the \"Learning\" page, explain the dialogue and ask the students to repeat after you a few times. Tell the students that this lesson will focus on \"plurals.\" Introduce this new idea. Have the students count all the pens or pencils they have. As they are counting their books, pens, pencils, etc. ask how many items they have. Use the ball to go around to each student , asking and answering questions.","在“Learning”页面之后，解释对话并请学生跟着您复诵几次。告诉学生这一课的重点是“复数”，并介绍这个新概念。请学生数一数自己有几枝笔或铅笔；学生数书、笔、铅笔等东西时，问他们有几个。用球传给每位学生，进行问答。",0],["d","How many rulers?","T",0],["d","I can count 6 rulers.","S1",0],["d","How many books?","T",0],["d","I can count 7 books","S2",0],["d","How many erasers?","T",0],["d","I can count 8 erasers.","S3",0],["d","How many pens and pencils?","T",0],["d","I can count 9 pens and 10 pencils.","S4",0],["h3","(2) Enter the page \"Playing\"","(2) 进入“Playing”页面",0],["d","How many rulers?","Peter",0],["d","I can count 6 rulers.","Martian",0],["d","How many books?","Peter",0],["d","I can count 7 books.","Martian",0],["d","How many erasers?","Mary",0],["d","I can count 8 erasers.","Martian",0],["d","How many pens and pencils?","Mary",0],["d","I can count 9 pens and 10 pencils.","Martian",0],["h3","(3) Activity: To Assist the Front","(3) 活动：抢先送到前面",0],["p","Divide them into two teams. The Teacher chooses a number at ramdom. The students gather the amount that they heard from the Teacher. The fastest team wins.","把学生分成两队。老师随机选一个数字，学生要凑齐听到的数量，最快的队伍获胜。",0],["d","I want 5 pens.","T",0],["p","One of group 2: I can count 5 pens. (get one point)","第 2 组其中一人：I can count 5 pens.（得一分）",0],["d","I want 8 pencils.","T",0],["p","One of group 1: I can count 8 pencils. (get one point) Continue with this game until the students are familiar with this dialogue. Encourage some of the students that don't understand.","第 1 组其中一人：I can count 8 pencils.（得一分）持续进行这个游戏，直到学生熟悉这段对话。鼓励一些还不太懂的学生。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) In the Book Shop","Classroom Activities（30 mins）In the Book Shop 在书店",0],["h2","1.1",null,0],["p","Show the exercises which will be taught today on the monitor time. Then, keep teaching those exercises. Divide them into two teams. One person from Team A asks, \"How many girls?\"","先在屏幕上展示今天要教的练习，再继续教这些练习。把学生分成两队，A 队一人问：\"How many girls?\"",0],["d","I can count 5 girls. Ask them to answer the question immediately.","Team B",0],["h3","(1) Activity: Matching Game","(1) 活动：配对游戏",0],["p","Prepare two sets of cards. You can copy pages 6 and 7. One set has the number on it and the other set of cards has the question, \"How many _____? They have to match the cards. This requires them to get up and find their match. Keep alternating groups to make sure all of the students practice. S1 & S2 match together","准备两组卡片（可以复印第 6、7 页），一组写数字，另一组写问句 \"How many ___?\"。学生要把卡片配对，必须站起来找到配对的人。轮流换组，确认所有学生都练习到。S1 和 S2 配对：",0],["d","How many boys?","S1",0],["p","S2 (No.1): 9 boys. Keep going this way and encourage the students to speak loudly.","S2（1 号）：9 boys. 依照这样继续进行，并鼓励学生大声说。",0],["h2","1.2",null,0],["p","Show the exercises which will be taught today on the monitor time. Then, keep teaching those exercises. Have each student click on the words (cat, count, car, ice cream) and introduce the \"hard C\" sound. Go over the words with the steps. Spell the words for them. Practice spelling and saying these new words until you think they are comfortable with them.","先在屏幕上展示今天要教的练习，再继续教这些练习。请每位学生点击单词（cat、count、car、ice cream），介绍“硬 C”的音。依照步骤逐一练习这些单词，拼给学生听。练习拼写和念这些新单词，直到您觉得学生都很熟练。",0],["h3","(2) Activity: Circle Game","(2) 活动：圈圈游戏",0],["p","Divide them into two teams. Write \"C\", \"G\" and \"D\" on the board. Say a word with one of the sounds. They have to circle the letter, which they think is the correct sound. The first student can have one point for their team. You also can have them do this individually.","把学生分成两队，在黑板上写“C”、“G”和“D”。老师说一个含有其中一个音的单词，学生要圈出他们认为正确的字母，最先圈对的学生为自己的队伍得一分。也可以让学生个别进行。",0],["d","\"C\"","T",0],["p","S from Team1:(Circle the \"C\" first)","第 1 队学生：（先圈出“C”）",0],["d","\"G\"","T",0],["p","S from Team 2: (Circle the \"G\" first, then have one point.)","第 2 队学生：（先圈出“G”，得一分）",0],["h2","1.3",null,0],["p","First, show the exercises which will be practiced today on the monitor, and then read each example slowly and clearly.Emphasize the hard sounds. The students are fairly familiar with this procedure. If they hear the hard \"C\", have them check the appropriate box. Go over the correct answers with your students. Correct any of their mistakes and help them hear the difference between the hard \"C\" and the hard \"G\".","先在屏幕上展示今天要练习的题目，再慢慢、清楚地念出每个例子，强调硬音。学生对这个流程已经相当熟悉。听到硬“C”的音时，请学生在适当的方格打钩。和学生一起核对正确答案，纠正他们的错误，帮助他们听出硬“C”和硬“G”的差别。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\" Let's See And Say:","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the monologue of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say What can you buy in the supermarket? Hmm. You can almost buy anything in the supermarket. Yes! Let's go shopping together.","老师让学生听第一课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：What can you buy in the supermarket? Hmm. You can almost buy anything in the supermarket. Yes! Let's go shopping together.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialogue (that the students have just practiced) and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (Teachers can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with others. At this stage, Teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这段对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so they have an understanding. Pick one or two students to practicing saying the answers to the class.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。挑一两位学生练习向全班说出答案。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have students write them down in their Progress Report Book.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some written comments or encouragement. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[25,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 1 Classroom","Activities","Lesson 14","Song: Ten Little Indians"]],[33,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1"]],[33,["Learning/playing"]],[62,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1","1. 1","1.2","1.3"]],[95,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["In the Book Shop"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[14,15,16,17],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To identify colors in conjunction with \"to be.\"","能搭配 be 动词说出颜色。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","- Offering to help","- 主动提供帮忙",1],["li","-Accepting offers","- 接受别人的帮忙",1],["li","-Expressing appreciation","- 表达感谢",1],["li","-Responding to expressions of gratitude","- 回应别人的感谢",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","color flashcards, vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment","颜色单词卡、单词单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A Lesson 2","Classroom Activities 2A 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","colors, kite, look, yellow, blue, red, green, black, white, brown",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is it (color)? Yes, it is (color.)",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Soft c","软 c",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 7","EEC 1 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","banana, melon, papaya, guava",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Need a hand?","A",1],["d","Yes, please.","B",1],["p","Thanks a lot.",null,1],["d","Don't mention it.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Review conversation that they have learned in Class 1.","1. 复习第 1 课学过的对话。",0],["li","2. Have the students say the number and listen carefully. Pay attention to the order.","2. 请学生说出数字并仔细听，注意顺序。",0],["d","one","S1",0],["d","two","S2",0],["d","three Keep going with the other numbers up to 10.","S3",0],["li","3. Activity: Hitting Game","3. 活动：敲打游戏",0],["li","(1) Have the students switch the cards.","(1) 请学生交换卡片。",0],["li","(2) Call out a student's name each time, give him/ her a word from previous lesson to spell.","(2) 每次叫一位学生的名字，给他一个之前学过的单词拼拼看。",0],["li","(3) The student should repeat the word and spell it.","(3) 学生要复诵单词并拼出来。",0],["d","eraser","T",0],["d","e-r-a-s-e-r","S",0],["d","pencil","T",0],["d","p-e-n-c-i-l","S",0],["li","(4) Spelling Quiz","(4) 拼写小测验",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 2 Colors","Classroom Activities（30 mins）第 2 课 Colors 颜色",0],["h3","Learning","学习（Learning）",0],["p","Show the new sentences which will be taught today using the monitor. Then, keep teaching using those sentences.","用屏幕展示今天要教的新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。",0],["h3","(1) Enter the page \"Learning\"","(1) 进入“Learning”页面",0],["li","1. Keep the color flashcards in your hands. Teach them first, then point to certain objects around the room and identify what colors the objects are.","1. 手上拿着颜色单词卡，先教颜色，再指着教室里的一些物品，说出它们是什么颜色。",0],["li","2. Introduce the new sentence patterns, \"Is it yellow?\" \"Yes, it is\" / \"No, it is not.\" Practice the colors several times.","2. 介绍新句型：\"Is it yellow?\" \"Yes, it is.\" / \"No, it is not.\" 反复练习颜色几次。",0],["d","Is it yellow?","T",0],["d","Yes, it is.","S1",0],["d","Is it red?","T",0],["d","No, it is not. (Make sure all the students take at least one turn.)","S2",0],["h3","(2) Enter the page \"Playing\"","(2) 进入“Playing”页面",0],["p","Show the new sentences on the monitor. And then, keep teaching using those sentences. Choose two students to demonstrate.","在屏幕上展示新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。选两位学生示范。",0],["d","Look, _____ (Name)! It is a kite.","T",0],["d","Is it red?","T",0],["d","Yes, it is red.","S1",0],["d","It is green and brown.","S2",0],["d","It is black and white.","S1",0],["h3","(3) Activity: Roll Call","(3) 活动：点名",0],["p","Divide them into two teams. Ask the students to show and speak out two colors from their clothes; they can get one point for speaking right.","把学生分成两队，请学生指出并说出自己衣服上的两种颜色，说对就得一分。",0],["d","______(Someone's name) What color is it?","T",0],["d","It is green and yellow.","S1",0],["d","______(Someone's name) What color is it?","T",0],["d","It is black and white.","S2",0],["p","Let every student take turns at least one time.","让每位学生至少轮到一次。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 2 Colors","Classroom Activities（35 mins）第 2 课 Colors 颜色",0],["h2","2.1",null,0],["h3","Activity Sheet 1","活动单 1",0],["li","1. Review the vocabulary today before doing the sheet.","1. 写活动单前先复习今天的单词。",0],["li","2. For part I, let the students trace the sentences and then match the sentences and the pictures.","2. 第一部分：请学生描写句子，再把句子和图片配对。",0],["li","3. For part II, lead the students to draw the lines from the blanks to the pictures, then practice asking and answering the questions according to the lines.","3. 第二部分：带学生从空格画线连到图片，再依照连线练习问答。",0],["li","4. After practicing, have the students write down the correct answers in the blanks.","4. 练习完后，请学生在空格中写下正确答案。",0],["h2","2.2",null,0],["p","First, show the new words which will be taught today using the monitor. Then, keep teaching using those words. Have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","先用屏幕展示今天要教的新单词，再继续用这些单词教学。请学生跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["d","pencil","C",0],["d","pencil","Ss",0],["d","policeman","C",0],["d","policeman.(Show all the words for this part.)","Ss",0],["h2","2.3",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students open their books and turn to page 15","(1) 请学生打开课本翻到第 15 页。",0],["li","(2) Ask the students to listen to the teacher pronounce the word. You should remind students to identify the \"hard c\" sound, and \"soft c\" sound.","(2) 请学生听老师念单词，提醒学生分辨“硬 c”和“软 c”的音。",0],["li","(3) You should go around to all the students to make sure they all understand.","(3) 走到每位学生旁边，确认大家都懂了。",0],["li","(4) After they have finished, pick one of students to use the monitor and correct him each time. Other students will follow him/her.","(4) 完成后，挑一位学生操作屏幕，每次都帮他订正，其他学生跟着他做。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the Teacher needs to read the dialog to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the dialog script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念对话给学生听（对话稿请参考附录）；第 2 题则播放 MP3 给全班听。",0],["li","(1) Listen and label with the number 1, 2, or 3","(1) 听一听，标上数字 1、2 或 3",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the dialog to the students and have them listen to you and do the exercise. (Teachers can read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念对话给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and label","(2) 听一听，标上名称",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monologue in the Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise. (As it indicates below.) ?? Let's Check Monolog Fruit is good for your body. What kind of fruit do you like the most? Please turn to page 30. Let's check. Listen and label. Now, let's practice the vocabulary together.","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导（如下）。Let's Check 独白：Fruit is good for your body. What kind of fruit do you like the most? Please turn to page 30. Let's check. Listen and label. Now, let's practice the vocabulary together.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (Teacher can play the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have students write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today. 1-Total Review 2-Homework Exercises 3-Progress Report Book","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。1. 总复习 2. 作业练习 3. 学习进度手册",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 1","电话教学教材 1",0],["d","Hello.","T",0],["d","Hello","S",0],["d","Let's count to 10. 1, 2, 3, 4, ......10.","T",0],["d","1, 2, 3, 4...10.","S",0],["d","Good. How many books? (Tell your student a number and count with them)","T",0],["d","I can count ____ books.","S",0],["d","Good. Now please tell me four colors. (any 4 colors they've learned).","T",0],["d","red, green, yellow, brown.","S",0],["d","Very good. Make a sentence with red apple.","T",0],["d","_________________________.","S",0],["d","How old are you?","T",0],["d","I am _________.","S",0],["d","Very Good! Bye-bye.","T",0],["d","Bye-bye.","S",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Class 1"]],[40,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 2","Learning","Playing","2.1","2.2","2.3"]],[103,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Colors"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[18,19,20],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To describe nouns","能描述名词。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Offering to help","- 主动提供帮忙",1],["li","-Accepting offers","- 接受别人的帮忙",1],["li","-Expressing appreciation","- 表达感谢",1],["li","-Responding to expression of gratitude","- 回应别人的感谢",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","vocabulary flashcards, puppets, flashcards, four puppets (clean, dirty, small, big), digital equipment","单词单词卡、布偶、单词卡、四个布偶（clean、dirty、small、big）、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A Lesson 3","Classroom Activities 2A 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","big, small, dirty, clean",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","It is big (small).It is clean(dirty).",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","s",null,1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 7","EEC 1 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","banana, melon, papaya, guava",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Need a hand?","A",1],["d","Yes, please.","B",1],["p","Thanks a lot.",null,1],["d","Don't mention it.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Review the conversation they have learned in Class 2.","1. 复习第 2 课学过的对话。",0],["li","2. Q & A :",null,0],["d","Show me something yellow.","T",0],["d","This is yellow.","S1",0],["d","Show me something red.","T",0],["d","This is red.","S2",0],["li","3. Spelling Quiz :","3. 拼写小测验：",0],["li","(1) Have the students take out their Progress Report Book or Notebook for the test.","(1) 请学生拿出学习进度手册或笔记本准备小测验。",0],["li","(2) T : yellow",null,0],["d","(Write \"yellow\" in the book.)","Ss",0],["d","blue","T",0],["d","(Write \"blue\" in the book.)","Ss",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 3: Animals at the Zoo","Classroom Activities（35 mins）第 3 课 Animals at the Zoo 动物园的动物",0],["h3","Learning","学习（Learning）",0],["p","First, show the new sentences, which will be taught today using the monitor. Then, keep teaching using those sentences.","先用屏幕展示今天要教的新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。",0],["h3","(1) Enter the page \"Learning\"","(1) 进入“Learning”页面",0],["p","Ask the students what they can see at the zoo. Give them suggestions for this topic, Like elephant , big elephant, or, bird , small bird... for extending the topic today. Now we're going to \"Beijing Zoo,\" everybody, Let's go.","问学生在动物园可以看到什么，给他们一些提示来延伸今天的主题，例如 elephant、big elephant，或 bird、small bird……现在我们要去“北京动物园”，大家出发吧！",0],["d","It is big.","C",0],["p","T/S: It is big.",null,0],["d","It is small.","C",0],["p","T/S: It is small. Go through the dialogue with students.","T/S: It is small. 和学生一起把对话练习一遍。",0],["h3","(2) Enter the page \"Playing\"","(2) 进入“Playing”页面",0],["p","First, show the new sentences , which will be taught today using the monitor. Then , keep teaching using those sentences. Choose two of students to demonstrate.","先用屏幕展示今天要教的新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。选两位学生示范。",0],["d","big. It is big. (Click \"pause\" on the big elephant and ask the students to repeat.)","T",0],["d","big. It is big,","Ss",0],["d","small. It is small. (Click \"pause\" on the big elephant and ask the students to repeat.)","T",0],["d","small. It is small.","Ss",0],["d","dirty. It is dirty. (Click \"pause\" on the big elephant and ask the students to repeat.)","T",0],["d","dirty. It is dirty.","Ss",0],["d","clean. It is clean. (Click \"pause\" on the big elephant and ask the students to repeat.)","T",0],["d","clean. It is clean.","Ss",0],["h2","3.1",null,0],["p","This exercise is to practice what you've been teaching them already. Pair them up for this exercise. I suggest that you role-play for practicing. Have a couple of students come to the front. Have them read all four examples. Encourage all the students to do this.","这个练习是要练习您已经教过的内容。让学生两两一组做这个练习，建议用角色扮演的方式。请几位学生到前面，念出全部四个例子，鼓励所有学生都试试看。",0],["d","Is it big","S1",0],["d","Yes, it is. It is big.","S2",0],["d","Is it big?","S1",0],["d","No, it is not. It is small.","S3",0],["d","Is it dirty?","S1",0],["d","Yes, it is. It is dirty.","S4",0],["p","kkPlease, have students finish all the items in page18.","请学生完成第 18 页的所有题目。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 3 Animals at the Zoo","Classroom Activities（30 mins）第 3 课 Animals at the Zoo 动物园的动物",0],["h2","3.2",null,0],["li","1. Role-play: Divide the class into two teams. Place big/small and dirty/clean puppets in front of them and have them ask each other whether the puppets are big or small, dirty or clean. Do this for a few minutes until they all understand.","1. 角色扮演：把全班分成两队，把 big/small 和 dirty/clean 的布偶放在学生面前，请他们互相问布偶是大还是小、脏还是干净。进行几分钟，直到大家都懂了。",0],["li","2. Stepping Stones: Draw a river on the board and two sets of stones going across the river. Two teams. For a team to take a step on their set of stones, they have to guess if an object is big or small, dirty or clean. Use the flashcards. If they guess the object correctly, they get the stone. If the answer is incorrect, they lose their turn. See which team gets to the destination first using stones (magnets or something that can be stuck on the board) will be the winner. S(Team1): Is he big? S(Team2): Yes, he is. He is big. (Team 1 gets to take a stone.) S(Team2):Is she big? S(Team1):No, she is not. She is not big. She is small.","2. 踩石头过河：在黑板上画一条河，河上有两排石头，分成两队。每队要往前踩一步石头，就要猜出一样东西是大还是小、脏还是干净（使用单词卡）。猜对就拿到石头，猜错就失去这一轮。用石头（磁铁或可以贴在黑板上的东西）先到达对岸的队伍获胜。S（第 1 队）：Is he big? S（第 2 队）：Yes, he is. He is big.（第 1 队拿一颗石头）S（第 2 队）：Is she big? S（第 1 队）：No, she is not. She is not big. She is small.",0],["h2","3.3",null,0],["li","1. Have them open their books to page 20. Read each of the examples and have the students repeat after you. This is a very easy sound to make, but make sure your students don't pronounce \"S\" with \"SH\" sound. Tell them to pretend they're snakes and they're making a hissing sound. The tongue is in the middle of the mouth behind the teeth.","1. 请学生打开课本第 20 页，念出每个例子并请学生跟着您复诵。这个音很容易发，但要确认学生不要把“S”念成“SH”。告诉他们假装自己是蛇，发出嘶嘶声；舌头放在嘴巴中间、牙齿后面。",0],["li","2. You might want to incorporate some of the new adjectives into this exercise. For instance, you could say, \"snake-Is it a big snake?\" Or \" It is a big snake.\"","2. 可以在这个练习中加入一些新的形容词，例如说 \"snake – Is it a big snake?\" 或 \"It is a big snake.\"",0],["h2","3.4",null,0],["li","1. Say the word slowly and carefully. They will be listening for the \"S\" sound At the beginning of the word. Have them put a check if it starts with \"S\" and an \"X\" if it doesn't.","1. 慢慢、仔细地念出单词，学生要听词首有没有“S”的音。是“S”开头就打钩，不是就打“X”。",0],["li","2. Mime Game: Have an outgoing student come to the front of class. Whisper The word you want them to mime or act out. Then have them mime the word and see if the other students can guess the action. Set a time limit of 1 minute. The team that guesses the most answers wins.","2. 比手画脚：请一位外向的学生到教室前面，小声告诉他要表演的单词，让他用动作表演出来，看其他学生能不能猜出来。每题限时 1 分钟，猜对最多的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I Do?",null,0],["li","Step 1: Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","步骤 1：用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["li","Step 2: Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and have them check ( ) the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do, to the class.","步骤 2：解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，请学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["li","Step3: Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for this unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and Teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","步骤 3：让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1)Write the main learning items on the board and have students write it down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2)Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Class 2"]],[38,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3"]],[38,["Learning","Playing","3.1","3.2"]],[67,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 3","3.1","3.2","3.3","3.4"]],[81,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Animals at the Zoo"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[21,22,23,24],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To describe people and animals","能描述人和动物。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Ordering food/ drinks","- 点餐／点饮料",1],["li","-Asking others to repeat themselves","- 请别人再说一次",1],["li","-Taking orders","- 帮别人点餐",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","adjective flashcards, small magnets, a fishing pole, number flashcards, the digital equipment","形容词单词卡、小磁铁、一根钓竿、数字单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities Lesson 4","Classroom Activities 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","tall, short, fat, thin, giraffe",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","He is short. She is fat. It is thin.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Short \"a\"","短元音“a”",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 8","EEC 1 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","napkin, cup, straw, cookies",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Two milk shakes.","A",1],["d","Pardon?","B",1],["d","Two milk shakes, please.","A",1],["d","Right away.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Review the words that they have learned before in Class 3.","1. 复习第 3 课学过的单词。",0],["h3","2. Activity: Spelling","2. 活动：拼写",0],["li","(1) Have the students stand in the class.","(1) 请学生在教室里站起来。",0],["li","(2) Students should spell the word. If the answer is right, they can sit down.","(2) 学生要拼出单词，拼对的人就可以坐下。",0],["d","big","T",0],["d","b-i-g","S1",0],["d","dirty","T",0],["d","d-i-r-t-y 3.Quiz: Have a spelling quiz at this time.","S",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 4: At the Zoo","Classroom Activities（35 mins）第 4 课 At the Zoo 在动物园",0],["h3","(1) Enter the \"Learning\" page","(1) 进入“Learning”页面",0],["p","1.Teach some more adjectives in this lesson. 2.Please prepare some materials for examples, especially using a pig or other fat things to emphasize fat.","1. 这一课要多教一些形容词。2. 请准备一些实例教材，特别是用猪或其他胖胖的东西来强调 fat。",0],["li","(2) Enter the page \"Playing\"","(2) 进入“Playing”页面",0],["li","1. First, show the new sentences, which will be taught today using the monitor. Then, keep teaching using those sentences.","1. 先用屏幕展示今天要教的新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。",0],["d","tall. It is tall.","T",0],["d","short. It is short.","T",0],["d","fat. She is fat.","T",0],["d","fat. She is fat.","Ss",0],["d","thin. It is thin.","T",0],["h2","4.1",null,0],["li","(3) Activity: Parrot Game The students are the parrots and must repeat what you say, but only if your statement is true. If the statement is false, the students should remain silent. The statements can be about anything.","(3) 活动：鹦鹉游戏。学生当鹦鹉，要重复您说的话，但只有在您说的是真的时候才能重复；如果说的是错的，学生要保持安静。内容可以是任何事情。",0],["d","It is tall. (the statement is true)","T",0],["d","It is tall.","Ss",0],["d","It is fat. (the statement is true)","T",0],["d","It is fat.","Ss",0],["d","It is big. (the statement is false)","T",0],["d","(Keep silent)","Ss",0],["p","Pair of students, ask and answer the questions using the flashcards.","学生两两一组，用单词卡练习问答。",0],["d","Is it short ?","S1",0],["d","Yes, he is.","S2",0],["d","Is he thin ?","S1",0],["d","No, he is not.","S2",0],["p","He is a fat boy. Let the students finish page 24~25.","He is a fat boy. 请学生完成第 24–25 页。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins) Lesson 4: At the Zoo","Classroom Activities（30 mins）第 4 课 At the Zoo 在动物园",0],["h2","4.2",null,0],["li","(1) Read the four examples to your students, then have them repeat after you.","(1) 念出四个例子给学生听，再请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["d","apple","T",0],["d","apple","Ss",0],["d","cat","T",0],["d","cat","Ss",0],["li","(2) Show all the words for this part. Activity: \"Go Fishing\"","(2) 展示这部分的所有单词。活动：“钓鱼”",0],["li","● Make some cards with short \"a\" words written on them. For example: apple, cat, rabbit, taxi","● 做一些写有短元音“a”单词的卡片，例如：apple、cat、rabbit、taxi。",0],["li","● Give a \"fishing pole\" to one of your students.","● 把一根“钓竿”交给一位学生。",0],["li","● Call out one of the words and have the student \"go fishing\" for it.","● 说出其中一个单词，请学生去“钓”这个字。",0],["li","● When they catch the right word, they have to hold up the card and say the word.","● 钓到正确的单词后，要举起卡片并说出这个字。",0],["h2","4.3",null,0],["li","(1) Have the students open their books and turn to page 27.","(1) 请学生打开课本翻到第 27 页。",0],["li","(2) You should say these words very slowly and clearly. Correct their mistakes and review the mistakes.","(2) 非常慢、非常清楚地念出这些单词，纠正学生的错误并复习错的地方。",0],["li","(3) Activity: \"Remember It\"","(3) 活动：“记住它”",0],["li","● Choose 10 flashcards with the words they've learned.","● 选出 10 张学过的单词单词卡。",0],["li","● Show the cards twice, then put the cards away.","● 展示卡片两次后收起来。",0],["li","● Try to show them the cards with short \"a\" sound like cat, apple, ..etc.","● 尽量展示有短元音“a”的卡片，例如 cat、apple 等。",0],["li","● You can call on your students individually or by team, depending on the class size.","● 依班级人数，可以个别点学生或分队进行。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See and Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the monologue of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say Do you know how to order food in a restaurant? Now, let's enjoy the food together.","老师让学生听本课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：Do you know how to order food in a restaurant? Now, let's enjoy the food together.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialogue that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (Teachers can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other At this stage, Teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have students write it down in their progress report books.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 2","电话教学教材 2",0],["d","Hello. How are you?","T",0],["d","Fine, thank you. And you?","S",0],["d","Good, thanks. Is he short? (Open \"Classroom Activities\"to Lesson 3 & 4)","T",0],["d","Yes, he is short.","S",0],["d","Is she a tall girl?","T",0],["d","Yes, she is a tall girl.","S",0],["d","Is it big?","T",0],["d","No, it is not big.","S",0],["d","Are you fat?","T",0],["d","No, I am not fat","S",0],["d","Are you dirty?","T",0],["d","No, I am not dirty.","S",0],["d","That's good. Goodbye.","T",0],["d","Byebye.","S",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 3","大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","Learning"]],[43,["Playing","4.1","4.2","4.3"]],[94,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":["At the Zoo"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[25,26,27],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To describe plurals","能描述复数。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Ordering food/ drinks","- 点餐／点饮料",1],["li","-Asking others to repeat themselves","- 请别人再说一次",1],["li","-Taking orders","- 帮别人点餐",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","adjective flashcards, vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment, two sets of sentence cards of \"They are boys/girls.\"","形容词单词卡、单词单词卡、数字教学设备、两组“They are boys/girls.”句子卡",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A Lesson 5","Classroom Activities 2A 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","they, are, hamburgers, popsicles",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are they boys? They are hamburgers. They are small.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Short \"e\"","短元音“e”",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 8","EEC 1 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","napkin, cup, straw, cookies",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Two milk shakes.","A",1],["d","Pardon?","B",1],["d","Two milk shakes, please.","A",1],["d","Right away.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins) Lesson 5: At the Snack Bar","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）第 5 课 At the Snack Bar 在点心吧",0],["li","1. Review the sentence patterns and adjectives learned in Class 4.","1. 复习第 4 课学过的句型和形容词。",0],["h3","2. Activity: Spelling and Writing","2. 活动：拼写与书写",0],["li","(1) Divide the students into two groups.","(1) 把学生分成两组。",0],["li","(2) The first group comes to the board. Write down the words that they've learned before. Then switch the activity to the other group.","(2) 第一组到黑板前，写出之前学过的单词，再换另一组进行。",0],["li","(3) At the end of the game have all the winners compete against each other for the top speller award in class.","(3) 游戏最后，让所有优胜者互相比赛，争夺全班“拼写王”。",0],["li","(4) Encourage some of the weaker students to try harder.","(4) 鼓励一些较弱的学生更加努力。",0],["d","short","T",0],["d","(Write \"short\")","S1",0],["d","thin","T",0],["d","(Write \"thin\")","S",0],["li","3. Quiz: Give the students a quiz in spelling for 5 minutes.","3. 小测验：进行 5 分钟的拼写小测验。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (35 mins) Lesson 5 At the Snack Bar","Classroom Activities（35 mins）第 5 课 At the Snack Bar 在点心吧",0],["h3","(1) Enter the page \"Learning\"-","(1) 进入“Learning”页面",0],["li","1. We will teach plural sentences in this lesson.","1. 这一课要教复数句子。",0],["li","2. Have one student stand up. Say, \"He/ She is a boy/ girl\". He/ She is tall.","2. 请一位学生站起来，说 \"He/She is a boy/girl. He/She is tall.\"",0],["h3","(2) Enter the page \"Playing\"","(2) 进入“Playing”页面",0],["li","1. First, show the new sentences which will be taught today using the monitor. Then, keep teaching using those sentences.","1. 先用屏幕展示今天要教的新句子，再继续用这些句子教学。",0],["d","They are boys. They are tall.","T",0],["d","They are boys. They are tall.","Ss",0],["d","They are girls. They are fat.","T",0],["d","They are girls. They are fat.","Ss",0],["h3","(3) Activity: Matching","(3) 活动：配对",0],["li","1. Divide the students into two teams. Prepare two sets of sentence cards then cut them word by word.","1. 把学生分成两队。准备两组句子卡，把句子一个字一个字剪开。",0],["li","2. Mix each sentence together.","2. 把每个句子的单词卡混在一起。",0],["d","They are boys.","T",0],["p","Team A/ Team B has to make \"They are boys\" in the correct order. The winner can get one point.","A 队／B 队要把 \"They are boys\" 排成正确的顺序，获胜的队伍得一分。",0],["d","They are girls.","T",0],["p","Team A/ Team B has to make \" They are girls\" in the correct order. The winner can get one point.","A 队／B 队要把 \"They are girls\" 排成正确的顺序，获胜的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","5.1 ~ 5.2 Jumping Activity","5.1–5.2 跳跳活动",0],["li","1. Prepare two chairs with the words \"Yes\" and \"No.\"","1. 准备两张椅子，分别写上“Yes”和“No”。",0],["li","2. Show the class the pictures in page 30 and 31 and ask them questions from the pictures.","2. 给全班看第 30、31 页的图片，并根据图片问问题。",0],["li","3. If the answer is positive, have the kids jump to the \"Yes.\"","3. 答案是肯定的，就让孩子跳到“Yes”。",0],["li","4. If the answer is negative, have the kids jump to the \"No.\"","4. 答案是否定的，就让孩子跳到“No”。",0],["d","Are they hamburgers? (Point to the right picture of page 31.)","T",0],["p","S1&S2: (Jump to \"Yes.\") Yes, they are. They are hamburgers.","S1&S2：（跳到“Yes”）Yes, they are. They are hamburgers.",0],["d","Are they boys? (Point to the left picture of page 30.)","T",0],["p","S1&S2: (Jump to \"No.\") No, they are not. They are not boys . They are girls. 5.The game ends with asking them four questions.","S1&S2：（跳到“No”）No, they are not. They are not boys. They are girls. 5. 问四个问题后游戏结束。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins): At the Snack Bar","Classroom Activities（30 mins）：At the Snack Bar 在点心吧",0],["h2","5.3",null,0],["li","(1) The sound of short \"e\" is easily confused with the short \"a\".","(1) 短元音“e”的音很容易和短元音“a”混淆。",0],["li","(2) Go over the examples on page 32.","(2) 逐一练习第 32 页的例子。",0],["li","(3) Call the students individually, gently correct their pronunciation errors.","(3) 个别叫学生念，温和地纠正他们的发音错误。",0],["h2","5.4",null,0],["li","(1) They're very familiar with this little quiz already.","(1) 学生对这种小测验已经非常熟悉。",0],["li","(2) Read through the words slowly and clearly. Really emphasize the short \"e\".","(2) 慢慢、清楚地念出单词，特别强调短元音“e”。",0],["li","(3) Activity: Tic-tac-toe □ Draw a tic-tac-toe grid on the board. □ Fill in the squares with words with the short \"a\" and the short \"e\". □ Divide the class into two teams, Team \"X\" and Team \"O.\" □ Alternate turns of teams identifying the things in the squares. □ If they say the word correctly, they win the square. □ The first team to get three in a row wins the game.","(3) 活动：圈圈叉叉 □ 在黑板上画井字格。□ 在格子里填入有短元音“a”和短元音“e”的单词。□ 把全班分成“X”队和“O”队。□ 两队轮流说出格子里的东西。□ 说对就得到那一格。□ 最先连成一线的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, teachers need to read the dialog to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the dialog script), and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念对话给学生听（对话稿请参考附录）；第 2 题则播放 MP3 给全班听。",0],["li","(1)Listen and label with the number 1, 2, or 3","(1) 听一听，标上数字 1、2 或 3",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the studentsbe \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in the correct order.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in the correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the dialog to the students and have them listen to you and do the exercise. (Teachers can read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念对话给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Listen to the words and connect them with a line","(2) 听单词，用线连起来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monologue of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise. (As it indicates below). Monolog Of Let's Check It's tea time now. Let's have some delicious cookies and a cup of juice. Please turn to page 34. Let's check. Listen to the words and connect them with a line.","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导（如下）。Let's Check 独白：It's tea time now. Let's have some delicious cookies and a cup of juice. Please turn to page 34. Let's check. Listen to the words and connect them with a line.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The Teacher can play the dialog for the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students to bring the markers next time.","(3) 提醒学生下次带彩笔。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4"]],[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities"]],[36,["Lesson 5","Learning","Playing","5.1","5.2","5.3","5.4"]],[93,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["At the Snack Bar"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[28,29],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","Review Lesson 1- Lesson 5","复习第 1 课–第 5 课",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["li","-Ordering food/drinks","- 点餐／点饮料",1],["li","-Asking others to repeat themselves","- 请别人再说一次",1],["li","-Taking orders","- 帮别人点餐",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Adjective flashcards, tape recorder, listening, tape, plastic ball, plastic hammer, quiz and listening lab., paper","形容词单词卡、录音机、听力录音带、塑料球、塑料锤、小测验与听力练习卷、纸",1],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,1],["p","Review Lesson 1- Lesson 5","复习第 1 课–第 5 课",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 8","EEC 1 第 8 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","napkin, cup, straw, cookies",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Two milk shakes.","A",1],["d","Pardon?","B",1],["d","Two milk shakes, please.","A",1],["d","Right away.","B",1],["h2","Review (20 mins)","复习 Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Use this time for catching up any lessons or areas that they did not have time for in the first five classes. If you feel your students are caught up enough, spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where the students seem to be having difficulties. You can do this through drills, games or activities. Review for the test. Get a copy of the test and go over each portion of it with the class. Don't show them the test or give them the exact answers. Instead, plan activities to reinforce each area of the test. When asking the questions from the test, rephrase the question or substitute other words in place of the ones on the test.","利用这段时间补上前五堂课中还没来得及完成的课程或部分。如果您觉得学生进度都跟上了，就用这段时间复习之前的课程，或学生似乎有困难的部分。可以通过操练、游戏或活动进行。为测验做复习：拿一份测验卷，和全班逐一复习每个部分。不要让学生看到考卷或给他们确切的答案，而是设计活动来加强测验的每个部分。问测验中的问题时，换个说法或用其他单词替代考卷上的字。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put all books and materials away. Hand out the quiz and have them do the quiz. Keep an eye on them. Make sure they don't cheat or talk during this time.","请学生把所有书本和用品收起来，发下考卷让学生作答。注意观察学生，确认他们在这段时间没有作弊或说话。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (25 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（25 mins）",0],["p","Have the students listen to the tape thoroughly once. Wait until they almost complete the questions, then play the tape again to let the students check their answers.","请学生完整听一次录音带，等他们差不多做完题目后，再播放一次让学生检查答案。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate square. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the Teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease, Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Review","1. 复习",0],["li","(1) Review EEC using the book.","(1) 用课本复习 EEC。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3)Remind the students to bring the markers next time.","(3) 提醒学生下次带彩笔。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 3","电话教学教材 3",0],["d","Please make a sentence with \"they.\"","T",0],["d","They are popsicles.","S",0],["d","Please make a sentence with \"we.\"","T",0],["d","We are girls.","S",0],["d","Is a giraffe short?","T",0],["d","No, it is not. It is tall.","S",0],["d","Are you happy?","T",0],["d","Yes, I am happy.","S",0],["d","Very good. See you.","T",0],["d","See you.","S",0]],"g":[[19,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Class 1- Class 5"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[30,31],"b":[["h2","Test Day 1","测验日 1",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","Review Test","复习与测验",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment, test paper","单词单词卡、数字教学设备、测验卷",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A",null,0],["p","Review lesson1 to lesson 5","复习第 1 课到第 5 课",0],["h2","Review (15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["li","1. Return the quizzes and Listening Labs to your students after you have corrected them. And remind your students of the mistakes they have already done. Help them understand the correct answers.","1. 把批改好的小测验和听力练习发还给学生，提醒学生犯过的错误，帮助他们了解正确答案。",0],["li","2. Use this time to review for the test. Go over any sentence patterns or any other areas where you think that students may need some review. Don't forget to practice for the oral test.","2. 利用这段时间为测验做复习，复习任何您认为学生可能需要加强的句型或其他部分。别忘了练习口语测验。",0],["h2","Test (45 mins)","测验 Test（45 mins）",0],["p","Have the students write the test in the classroom. Call on students individually to take the oral test outside the classroom. If there is a foreign teacher, let him/her do the oral test, or do it by yourself. Assign a classroom leader to monitor students' behavior while the Teacher is out of the classroom or T can observe the class through the window. The oral test is worth 20% of the test total. Bring a blank tape and record the oral test. Students can take their own tape home and let the parents listen to it. Listen to it later to determine in what areas the student may need help. Each question is worth 4 points; one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes.","请学生在教室里写测验卷，并个别叫学生到教室外进行口语测验。如果有外籍老师，请由外籍老师进行口语测验，或由您自己进行。老师不在教室时，指定一位班长维持秩序，或老师可以从窗外观察班级。口语测验占总成绩的 20%。准备一卷空白录音带录下口语测验，学生可以把自己的录音带带回家给家长听；之后再听一次，判断学生需要加强哪些部分。每题 4 分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各 1 分。给学生改正自己错误的机会。",0],["h3","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["h3","1. How many (noun)? (cid:0)Point to any objects.(cid:0)","1. How many (noun)?（指着任何物品）",0],["h3","2. Count from 1-10.","2. 从 1 数到 10。",0],["h3","3. Is it red?",null,0],["h3","4. Are they tall?",null,0],["h3","Are they thin?",null,0],["h3","5. Is it dirty?",null,0],["h2","Activity and Game (30 mins)","活动与游戏 Activity and Game（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review \"tall,\"\"short,\"\"fat\" and \"thin\" using the touchscreen all-in-one, then teach the actions \"tall,\"\"short,\"\"fat\" and \"thin\" to the students.","(1) 用触控一体机复习 \"tall\"、\"short\"、\"fat\"、\"thin\"，再教学生 tall、short、fat、thin 的动作。",0],["li","(2) Divide the class into two teams and number each student.","(2) 把全班分成两队，每位学生编号。",0],["li","(3) The Teacher clicks on any character in the touchscreen all-in-one to have it say, \"It is tall.\" ( Or choose any other adjective sentence).","(3) 老师点击触控一体机中的任一角色，让它说 \"It is tall.\"（或选其他形容词句子）。",0],["li","(4) Call a number, the students from each team have to act out whatever they hear from the touchscreen all-in-one.","(4) 喊一个号码，两队的这位学生要做出从触控一体机听到的动作。",0],["li","(5) The student who is the fastest is the winner. He wins a point for his/ her team.","(5) 最快的学生获胜，为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Remind the parents to sign the report for them or you will call the parents.","提醒家长在手册上签名，否则您会打电话给家长。",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["h3","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["h3","Evaluation Sheet","评估表",0],["li","(1) Have the students open the book to the third evaluation sheet and explain how to use it.","(1) 请学生打开手册翻到第三张评估表，说明使用方法。",0],["li","(2) Have every student repeat each item with you. And try to make them understand the meaning.","(2) 请每位学生跟着您复诵每个项目，并尽量让他们了解意思。",0],["li","(3) Then ask every student to do it. If they have any questions, help them right away.","(3) 接着请每位学生填写，有任何问题立即协助。",0],["li","(4) Record each student's scores for Quiz, Listening Lab, and Test in the appropriate column.","(4) 在适当的栏记录每位学生的小测验、听力练习和测验分数。",0],["li","(5) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(5) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[7,["None"]],[10,["None"]],[19,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","Playing"]],[25,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":100},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[32,33],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 1","活动日 1",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment, number flashcards, worksheet","单词单词卡、数字教学设备、数字单词卡、练习单",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["p","Review lesson 1 to lesson 5","复习第 1 课到第 5 课",0],["h2","Test Correction (10 mins)","订正测验 Test Correction（10 mins）",0],["p","Give the students their test results. Go over any mistakes and problem areas. Have the students correct their answers in five minutes.","把测验结果发给学生，讲评错误和有问题的部分，请学生在五分钟内订正答案。",0],["h2","Review Classroom Activities L1-L5 (50 mins)","复习 Classroom Activities 第 1–5 课（50 mins）",0],["p","Review Classroom Activities Lesson 1- Lesson 5 using the touchscreen all-in-one. The Teacher may get into 1.1, 2.1, 3.1, 4.1 and 5.1 to do a quick and interesting review. For example:","用触控一体机复习 Classroom Activities 第 1 课到第 5 课。老师可以进入 1.1、2.1、3.1、4.1 和 5.1，进行快速又有趣的复习。例如：",0],["li","(1) Get into 1.1 in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 进入触控一体机中的 1.1。",0],["li","(2) T (Point to the first picture): How many boys?","(2) T（指着第一张图）：How many boys?",0],["li","(3) Lead the students to count, \"one, two, three, ....nine.\"","(3) 带学生数：\"one, two, three... nine.\"",0],["li","(4) Ss: Nine boys.",null,0],["li","(5) Teacher clicks the picture then the touchscreen all-in-one says,\"How many boys?\" \"Nine boys.\"","(5) 老师点击图片，触控一体机说 \"How many boys?\" \"Nine boys.\"",0],["li","(6) T: Very good. Your answer is correct.",null,0],["li","(7) Follow the procedure to review any lessons the students aren't familiar with.","(7) 依照这个流程，复习学生还不熟悉的课程。",0],["h2","Let's Have Fun (30 mins)","一起玩 Let's Have Fun（30 mins）",0],["li","1. Now that they've recovered from their test results, use this time for number games and activities. \"Battleships\" is a great game for number review. Plus, it teaches them how to think strategically. The object of the game is to sink the other player's ships by naming the squares on which he has placed them. You'll need to pair them up for this. They need a piece of paper. Each player draws 2 grids on his paper.","1. 学生已经从测验结果中恢复心情，利用这段时间玩数字游戏和活动。“海战棋（Battleships）”是复习数字的好游戏，还能教学生策略思考。游戏目标是说出对方放船的格子，把对方的船击沉。需要让学生两两一组，每人一张纸，在纸上画 2 个格子。",0],["li","2. One grid is left blank and players will record their attempt to sink the other player's ships. The players put their ships on the other grid by coloring in some squares. They have one battleship, which stand for four squares; two cruisers, which stand for 3 squares; 2 frigates which stand for 2 squares; and 4 submarines which stand for 1 square. The ships can be placed anywhere on the grid horizontally or vertically, but not diagonally. The players sit facing each other, concealing their grids. Player 1 says a square. Player 2 looks at his grid and sees if Player 2 has hit anything. Player 2 must respond in one of three ways: miss, hit or sunk ( if the ship has been completely hit.) So, if there are no ships on the square that was called, they would say, \"miss\". The winner is the first player to sink all the other player's ships. This game could take the whole class time.","2. 一个格子空着，用来记录自己攻击对方船只的结果；另一个格子用来放自己的船，把一些格子涂上颜色。每人有一艘战舰（4 格）、两艘巡洋舰（3 格）、2 艘巡防舰（2 格）和 4 艘潜水艇（1 格）。船可以横放或直放在格子上，但不能斜放。两位玩家面对面坐，把格子藏好。玩家 1 说出一个格子，玩家 2 看自己的格子，检查有没有被打中，并用三种方式之一回应：miss（没打中）、hit（打中）或 sunk（整艘船都被打中而沉没）。如果说出的格子上没有船，就说 \"miss\"。最先击沉对方所有船只的人获胜。这个游戏可以玩一整堂课。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write \"Test\" on the board and have the students write it down in their progress report book.","(1) 在黑板上写“Test”，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h3","2-Evaluation Sheet","2. 评估表",0],["li","(1) Have the students open the book to the third evaluation sheet and explain how to use it.","(1) 请学生打开手册翻到第三张评估表，说明使用方法。",0],["li","(2) Have every student repeat each item with you. And try to make them understand the meaning.","(2) 请每位学生跟着您复诵每个项目，并尽量让他们了解意思。",0],["li","(3) And then, ask every student to do it. if they have any questions, help them right away.","(3) 接着请每位学生填写，有任何问题立即协助。",0],["li","(4) Record each student's score for Quiz, Listening Lab, and Test in the appropriate column.","(4) 在适当的栏记录每位学生的小测验、听力练习和测验分数。",0],["li","(5) Telephone Teaching Reminder:","(5) 电话教学提醒：",0],["p","Have students write down the time of today's telephone teaching and tell them to stay home and wait for your call.","请学生写下今天电话教学的时间，并告诉他们在家等您的电话。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["d","Hello! I am Teacher. How are you?","T",0],["d","I am fine, thank you. And you?","S",0],["d","I am OK. Thanks.","T",0],["d","Please take out your Classroom Activities Book and turn to page 22.","T",0],["p","Is the giraffe tall?",null,0],["d","Yes, it is tall.","S",0],["d","Look at page 23. Is the monkey fat?","T",0],["d","No, it is not fat. It is thin.","S",0],["d","Please turn to pages 28 and 29. How many hamburgers?","T",0],["d","Five hamburgers.","S",0],["d","Very good. Bye-bye.","T",0],["d","Bye-bye.","S",0]],"g":[[5,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson5"]],[7,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson5","1.1/ 2.1/ 3.1/ 4.1/ 5.1"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[34,35,36],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.A.",null,1],["p","To introduce the first person plural pronoun with the verb \"to be.\"","介绍第一人称复数代词搭配 be 动词。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Self-introductions Using good manners when meeting a new friend","自我介绍；认识新朋友时有礼貌",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","old and new adjective flashcards, new vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment","新旧形容词单词卡、新单词单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A, Lesson 6","Classroom Activities 2A 第 6 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","we, happy, good, friends, angry",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","We are happy. We are friends. Are you happy?",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Short \" i\"","短元音“i”",1],["h3","EEC 1, Lesson 9","EEC 1 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","balloon, cake, party, cola, snacks",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hello, I'm Julie Smith.","A",1],["d","I'm Bill Douglas.","B",1],["d","Nice to meet you, Bill.","A",1],["d","Nice to meet you, too, Julie.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Review the conversations they have learned in Class 5.","1. 复习第 5 课学过的对话。",0],["li","2. Use the adjectives they've learned first.","2. 先使用学过的形容词。",0],["h3","3. Hang Man","3. 吊人游戏（Hang Man）",0],["p","□ Have two teams. □ Indicate a spelling word for the students. □ The students must guess the word or the hangman will die!","□ 分成两队。□ 指定一个要拼的单词。□ 学生必须猜出这个字，否则吊人就会“死掉”！",0],["d","There are 3 letters. __ __ __. If you get it right, I'll fill in the blank.","T",0],["p","□ Explain that all words have vowels. Have them try to guess vowels first. Or, to help them understand the concept of vowels, you can fill in the vowels for them the first time. Team A S1: A A Team A S2: F F A Team A S3: T F A T","□ 说明每个字都有元音，请学生先猜元音。或者，为了帮助学生理解元音的概念，第一次可以先帮他们填上元音。A 队 S1：A；A 队 S2：F；A 队 S3：T……",0],["d","F-A-T, fat. Very good.","T",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 6: Good Friends (35 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 6 课 Good Friends 好朋友（35 mins）",0],["h3","(1) Enter the page \"Learning\"","(1) 进入“Learning”页面",0],["li","1. Introduce \"we\" to the class.","1. 向全班介绍 \"we\"。",0],["li","2. Teach \"we are.\"","2. 教 \"we are\"。",0],["li","3. Use the adjectives they've learned first.","3. 先使用学过的形容词。",0],["h3","4. Activity: Chain Drill","4. 活动：接龙练习",0],["d","We are thin. \"You\"","T",0],["d","You are thin. \"Fat\"","S1",0],["d","You are fat. \"Happy\"","S2",0],["d","You are happy. \"They\"","S3",0],["d","They are happy.","S4",0],["li","5. Keep going this way until the students are familiar with these sentence patterns.","5. 继续这样进行，直到学生熟悉这些句型。",0],["li","6. Encourage some of the weaker students to try to speak louder.","6. 鼓励一些较弱的学生试着说大声一点。",0],["h2","6.1-6.2",null,0],["li","1. Have each student stand up and ask and answer questions with 1 or 2 of his classmates. 2.Then he should write down the correct answer.","1. 请每位学生站起来，和 1 到 2 位同学互相问答。2. 再写下正确答案。",0],["d","Are you happy?","S1",0],["d","Yes, I am. (The student writes the sentence in the blank)","S2",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 6: Good Friends (30 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 6 课 Good Friends 好朋友（30 mins）",0],["h2","6.3",null,0],["p","Read through the four examples emphasizing the short \"I.\" Have them repeat this toghther and then individually. Then move them on to 6.4.","念出四个例子，强调短元音“i”。请学生先全班一起复诵，再个别复诵，然后进行 6.4。",0],["h2","6.4",null,0],["li","(1)Say the words clearly and precisely. There are three short vowel sounds in this exercise. Be careful with the short \"E\" and the short \"I.\" They sound very much alike.","(1) 清楚、准确地念出单词。这个练习有三个短元音，要特别注意短元音“e”和“i”，它们听起来很像。",0],["li","(2) Divide your class into two or three groups depending on the class size. Give each team all the letters of the alphabet. Call out a word they know. Speak two words that only have one vowel. The first team to spell the words correctly gets a point.","(2) 依班级人数把学生分成两组或三组，每队发一整套字母卡。说出一个学生认识的单词（只有一个元音的字），最先正确拼出单词的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm up the class by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the Let's See and Say monologue for lesson one. The teacher can read, or play the MP3 of the monolog, to the class. Lesson One Monolog:","老师让学生听本课的“Let's See and Say”独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听。本课独白：",0],["p","A birthday is a big day for everybody. They are having a good time. Come on! Let's have a happy time together.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and try to predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson ( based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened.) Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. Teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialogue (that the students have just practiced) and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (Teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so that they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[22,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activites","Class 6"]],[30,["大儿童学习去","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activites","Lesson 6","Learning","Part 2","Playing","6.1","6.2"]],[71,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Good Friends"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[37,38,39,40],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.A Review Lesson 1- Lesson 6","C.A. 复习第 1 课–第 6 课",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Self-introductions Using good manners when meeting a new friend","自我介绍；认识新朋友时有礼貌",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","vocabulary flashcards, color flags, number flashcards, a CD player, the digital equipment, a hammer","单词单词卡、彩色旗子、数字单词卡、CD 播放器、数字教学设备、一支锤子",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2A, Lesson 7","Classroom Activities 2A 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Review Lesson 1- Lesson 6","复习第 1 课–第 6 课",1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","hard \"c,\" soft \"c,\" soft \"a,\" short \"e,\" short \"i\"","硬“c”、软“c”、短元音“a”、短元音“e”、短元音“i”",1],["h3","EEC 1, Lesson 9","EEC 1 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","balloon, cake, party, cola, snacks",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hello, I'm Julie Smith.","A",1],["d","I'm Bill Douglas.","B",1],["d","Nice to meet you, Bill.","A",1],["d","Nice to meet you, too, Julie","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. We are going to review four parts in this class.","1. 这堂课要复习四个部分。",0],["li","2. Call the students' names and have each of them spell one of the words they've learned.","2. 叫学生的名字，请每个人拼出一个学过的单词。",0],["h3","3. Spelling Drill","3. 拼写练习",0],["p","Divide the students into two teams. The first student in each team should raise his hand.","把学生分成两队，每队第一位学生举手。",0],["d","happy","T",0],["d","h-a-p-p-y (She/ He can get one point for his team)","S1",0],["d","kite","T",0],["d","k-i-t-e (She/ He can get one point for his team)","S2",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 7: Going Out ( 35 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 7 课 Going Out 出门（35 mins）",0],["h2","7.1",null,0],["li","1. Show the students the items that they've learned before. Write them on the board, having the class repeat after you.","1. 拿出学生之前学过的东西给他们看，写在黑板上，请全班跟着您复诵。",0],["li","2. Point out some real objects in the classroom, so that they can practice using \"and.\" Move on to other adjectives to practice.","2. 指出教室里的一些实物，让学生练习使用 \"and\"，再换其他形容词练习。",0],["h3","3. Activity: Back to Back","3. 活动：背对背",0],["p","□ Divide the students into two teams. □ Prepare some colored flags in triangle □ Choose one student from each group □ Back to back and listen to music. □ When the music stops, both of them raise their hands to check if the flags have the same color. They can get one point for their team. \" If they can say the color, they get one more point for their team.","□ 把学生分成两队。□ 准备一些三角形的彩色旗子。□ 每组各选一位学生。□ 两人背对背听音乐。□ 音乐停止时，两人同时举起手，看旗子是不是同样的颜色，是的话可以为队伍得一分；如果能说出颜色，再多得一分。",0],["d","( Music ........) \"Stop\"","T",0],["p","S1 /S2 : Red",null,0],["d","Great Your team gets one point. Can you spell it?","T",0],["p","S1/S2 : r-e-d. (One more point) Keep going this way until everyone has practiced.","S1/S2: r-e-d.（再得一分）继续进行，直到每个人都练习过。",0],["li","4. Enter 7.1 Exercises:","4. 进入 7.1 练习：",0],["p","( Ask the students to make sentences with colors)","（请学生用颜色造句）",0],["d","No.1","T",0],["d","It is blue.","S1",0],["d","No.2","T",0],["d","They are green and red.","S2",0],["h2","7.2",null,0],["li","1. Go through the numbers with the class a couple of times.","1. 和全班一起把数字念几遍。",0],["li","2. Have them count forward and backward for both a counting exercise as well as a review of plurals.","2. 请学生顺着数、倒着数，同时练习数数和复习复数。",0],["li","3. Call on individual students.","3. 个别点学生。",0],["li","4. Activity: Ball Drill □ Before doing this activity, ask the students to finish exercise 7.2 first. □ Throw the ball to a student and ask a question. □ After that, the students throws the ball lightly to one of his classmates and asks the same question. □ T: How many keys? (Throw the ball to S1)","4. 活动：传球练习 □ 进行这个活动前，请学生先完成练习 7.2。□ 把球丢给一位学生并问一个问题。□ 接着，学生把球轻轻丢给一位同学，问同样的问题。□ T: How many keys?（把球丢给 S1）",0],["d","I can count 4 keys. (Throw the ball to S2)","S1",0],["d","How many books? (Throw the ball to S3)","T",0],["d","I can count 3 books.","S2",0],["p","□ Go around with this drill until they've all had a chance to participate.","□ 继续传球练习，直到所有人都有机会参与。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (30 mins)","Classroom Activities（30 mins）",0],["h2","7.3",null,0],["li","1. This is a series of seven practical exercises. Start out by saying the words in part A, and have the students repeat after you.","1. 这是一系列七个实用练习。先念出 A 部分的单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","2. Check their pronunciation. Move to part B. Say the hard \"c\" sound a couple of times. Go through 1-7. Have them draw a line from the hard \"c\" to the corresponding hard \"c.\"","2. 检查学生的发音后进行 B 部分。念几次硬“c”的音，逐一练习 1–7，请学生从硬“c”画线连到对应的硬“c”。",0],["li","3. Part C is the soft \"c\" sound.","3. C 部分是软“c”的音。",0],["li","4. Part D is the \"s\" sound.","4. D 部分是“s”的音。",0],["li","5. Part E is the short \"a\".","5. E 部分是短元音“a”。",0],["li","6. Part F is the short \"e\".","6. F 部分是短元音“e”。",0],["li","7. Part G is the short \"i\".","7. G 部分是短元音“i”。",0],["li","8. Activity: \"Jumble Game \"","8. 活动：“抢答游戏”",0],["li","9. Write Number 1 to Number 10 on the board.","9. 在黑板上写 1 到 10 号。",0],["li","10. Divide your class into two teams.","10. 把全班分成两队。",0],["li","11. Give them a plastic hammer.","11. 给他们一支塑料锤。",0],["li","12. Call out the number and have them \"whack\" the correct number.","12. 喊出数字，请学生“敲”正确的数字。",0],["li","13. The first one to \"whack\" the number receives a point for their team.","13. 最先“敲”到数字的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, teachers need to read the dialog to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the dialog script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念对话给学生听（对话稿请参考附录）；第 2 题则播放 MP3 给全班听。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and label with the number 1, 2, or 3","(1) 听一听，标上数字 1、2 或 3",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \"Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the dialog to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (Teachers can read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念对话给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2)Listen and check the pictures using \"V\" or \"X\"","(2) 听一听，用“V”或“X”勾选图片",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monologue in the Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise. Let's Check Monolog:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","It's a terrific birthday. Look! There's a big cake on the table. It's great. Please turn to page 38. Let's check the pictures using a check or an x. Let's practice the vocabulary.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture as they listen to the mp3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise as you play the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (Teachers can play the dialog for the class again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so that they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 5","电话教学教材 5",0],["d","Hello. How are you?","T",0],["d","I'm fine, thanks.","S",0],["d","Good. Please make a sentence using \"they.\"","T",0],["d","They are _____________.","S",0],["d","Please make a sentence using \"we.\"","T",0],["d","We are ______________.","S",0],["d","Good. Is Marty yellow?","T",0],["d","No, he is not yellow. He is green.","S",0],["d","Are you happy ?","T",0],["d","Yes, I am. I am happy.","S",0],["d","Excellent! Goodbye.","T",0],["d","Bye-bye.","S",0]],"g":[[19,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 7","Learning/Playing"]],[29,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 7","7.1","7.2","7.3"]],[91,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Going Out"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[41,42,43],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A To identify oneself and others","C.R./C.A.：能介绍自己和别人。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Self- introductions Using good manners when meeting a new a new friend","自我介绍；认识新朋友时有礼貌",1],["h3","Teaching Aid","教具",1],["p","new vocabulary flashcards, paper and vocabulary for the reconstruction game, hand puppet, ABC flashcards, an enlarged picture, balloons, coke, snacks","新单词单词卡、重组游戏用的纸和单词、手偶、ABC 单词卡、放大的图片、气球、可乐、点心",1],["h3","Classroom Readers L1/Classroom Activities 2B, Lesson 8","Classroom Readers 第 1 课／Classroom Activities 2B 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","hello, new, game, Sam, Kai, Katie, Charlie, Kim, Benny",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","I am (a) _________. You are (a) ________.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","m",null,1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 9","EEC 1 第 9 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","balloon, cake, party, cola, snacks",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Hello, I'm Julie Smith.","A",1],["d","I'm Bill Douglas.","B",1],["d","Nice to meet you, Bill.","A",1],["d","Nice to meet you, too, Julie.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (5 mins)","热身 Warm Up（5 mins）",0],["p","Do the spelling Quiz in the Progress Report Book. Quickly review Classroom Activities L1-7.","在学习进度手册上进行拼写小测验，并快速复习 Classroom Activities 第 1–7 课。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (30 mins)","Classroom Readers（30 mins）",0],["p","Page 4-5: Meet the stars of this book.","第 4–5 页：认识本书的主角。",0],["li","(1) Introduce the new words in page 4-5. Explain that Sam, Kai, Katie, Charlie, Kim and Benny are names. And they are the roles in Book 2. Emphasize Miss Brown is the way we call the teacher. They can't say \"Teacher Brown\".","(1) 介绍第 4–5 页的新单词。说明 Sam、Kai、Katie、Charlie、Kim 和 Benny 都是名字，也是 Book 2 的角色。强调 Miss Brown 是称呼老师的方式，不能说“Teacher Brown”。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 1 A New Student","Classroom Readers 第 1 课 A New Student 新同学",0],["li","(1) Teach the new words with phonics rules. If there is no rule, you just tell them.","(1) 用自然拼读规则教新单词；没有规则的字直接告诉学生。",0],["d","n-n-n","T",0],["d","/n/, /n/, /n/","Ss",0],["d","e-e-e","T",0],["d","/e/, /e/, /e/","Ss",0],["d","w-w-w","T",0],["d","/w/, /w/, /w/","Ss",0],["d","But we can't say the sound like /new/. So ew-ew-ew sounds like /ju/. \"new\" is /n/ -/ju/....","T",0],["d","/nju/.","Ss",0],["li","(2) After you've done this, you can play the reconstruction game. Take some words (including today's new words) that they know. Write each word on 1/4 size of A4 paper. Copy the list, one for each group of three students. Cut the words in half and mix them up. Recommend using only 10 words. Pass out a cut list to each group and tell them to start putting the words back together. The team that finishes first wins.","(2) 教完后，可以玩“单词重组游戏”。选一些学生认识的单词（包括今天的新单词），每个字写在 A4 纸的四分之一大小上。复印这份清单，每三位学生一组一份，把每个字从中间剪成两半并打乱。建议只用 10 个单词。把剪好的清单发给每一组，请他们开始把字拼回去，最先完成的队伍获胜。",0],["li","(3) Read the lesson word by word, sentence by sentence, then the whole page. Ask students to repeat after you step by step.","(3) 一个字一个字、一句一句，再整页念课文，请学生一步一步跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(4) Show the content of this lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask the students to follow the dialogue.You can use the pause button to stop it, so that the students can repeat.","(4) 用触控一体机展示本课内容，请学生跟着对话念。可以按暂停键，让学生复诵。",0],["li","(5) They should be familiar with the sentence patterns by now. Review the following sentence pattern using the chain drill. Use puppets to demonstrate. Have the puppet \"Mary\" in your right hand. I am a girl. I am Mary. You are a boy. You are Peter. Have the puppet \"Peter\" in your left hand. Yes, I am a boy. You are a girl. You are Mary.","(5) 学生现在应该已经熟悉这些句型。用接龙练习复习以下句型，用布偶示范：右手拿“Mary”布偶说 \"I am a girl. I am Mary. You are a boy. You are Peter.\"；左手拿“Peter”布偶说 \"Yes, I am a boy. You are a girl. You are Mary.\"",0],["li","(6) Continue around the room. The teacher can have the students substitute the word \"student\" for boy or girl.","(6) 在教室里继续轮流练习。老师可以让学生用 \"student\" 替换 boy 或 girl。",0],["d","I am Bill. (with Puppet Peter)","S1",0],["p","You are a girl. You are Lily.",null,0],["d","I am a girl. (with Puppet Mary)","S2",0],["p","You are a boy. You are Bill.",null,0],["li","(7) Q-A Ask the students to close the Readers. The Teacher turns to page 23 \"Reviewing What We Know\", asks the students to stand up, and asks them to answer the ques tions. The one who answers the question can sit down. The teacher can make up his own questions to ask them, but all these questions should be about Lesson 1.","(7) 问答：请学生合上读本。老师翻到第 23 页“Reviewing What We Know”，请学生站起来回答问题，答对的人可以坐下。老师也可以自己设计问题，但所有问题都要和第 1 课有关。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities L8: A New Student (45 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 8 课：A New Student 新同学（45 mins）",0],["h2","8.3 Phonics: \"M\"","8.3 自然拼读：\"M\"",0],["p","Say these \"m\" sound words slowly and clearly. This sound is easily confused with \"N\". Repeat this a number of times. Show the content of 8.3 using the touchscreen all-in-one. Pick some students to use the touchscreen all-in-one and say this sound after the touchscreen all-in-one.","慢慢、清楚地念出这些“m”音的单词。这个音很容易和“N”混淆，多重复几次。用触控一体机展示 8.3 的内容，挑几位学生操作触控一体机，跟着触控一体机念这个音。",0],["h2","8.4",null,0],["li","(1) Say the words and emphasize the M and N. Have patience. It takes a while to hear the difference between the two sounds.","(1) 念出单词，强调 M 和 N。要有耐心，学生需要一段时间才能听出这两个音的差别。",0],["h2","8.1",null,0],["p","The teacher introduces the new characters to the students. Start out by using the sentence pattern, \"She/he/it is a girl/boy/dog. Have the students repeat after you a few times. Then pick some unsuspecting students, point at the pictures, and ask who is in the pictures. Drill them together and individually for the remainder of the class.","老师向学生介绍新角色。先用句型 \"She/He/It is a girl/boy/dog.\"，请学生跟着您复诵几次，再挑几位没有预期的学生，指着图片问图中是谁。这堂课剩下的时间，用全班和个别的方式反复练习。",0],["h2","8.2 Playing a Game","8.2 玩游戏",0],["li","1. Introduce \"Playing a Game\" to them. Read through this first, then have your students repeat after you.","1. 向学生介绍“Playing a Game”。先念一遍，再请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","2. Show the content of 8.2 A using the touchscreen all-in-one, then assign different roles to the students. Do the role-plays in front of the class. This will help build confidence.","2. 用触控一体机展示 8.2 A 的内容，再分配不同角色给学生，在全班面前进行角色扮演，这能帮助建立自信。",0],["li","3. 8.2 B. Have them work in pairs for this exercise. Read the sentences and match them with the pictures. Show the contents of 8.2 B and 8.2 C using the touchscreen all-in-one. Then play the matching game. Copy the pictures of 8.2 B, cut up the pictures, and give each student a piece of paper. The students have to match the Q-A using the sentences of 8.2 C.","3. 8.2 B：请学生两两一组做这个练习，念出句子并和图片配对。用触控一体机展示 8.2 B 和 8.2 C 的内容，再玩配对游戏：复印 8.2 B 的图片并剪开，每位学生发一张，学生要用 8.2 C 的句子进行问答配对。",0],["h3","4. Activity Sheet 2","4. 活动单 2",0],["p","Ask the students to draw 3 pictures of their classmates, and then complete the blanks of A: You are . For example: One draws the student Joey, then he/she has to fill in the blanks-You are Joey. After that, have the students ask the classmates randomly according to the pictures they drew. Either the answer is \"Yes\" or \"No\" the one who has been asked has to write down the answers for his/her partner.","请学生画 3 张同学的图，再完成 \"A: You are ___.\" 的空格。例如：画了同学 Joey，就要填上 \"You are Joey.\"。接着请学生依照画的图随机问同学，不论答案是“Yes”或“No”，被问的人都要帮搭档写下答案。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate square. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog in this unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review what the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review what the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example and explain it so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题说明，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[21,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1","Learning & Playing"]],[26,["大儿童进阶","Big Kids","Book2","Classroom Activities","Lesson8","8.3/8.4","8.1/8.2"]],[49,["大儿童进阶","Big Kids","Book2","Classroom Activities"]],[51,["Lesson8","8.3","8.4","8.1","8.2"]],[67,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["A New Student"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[44,45,46,47],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/C.A. To identify and describe people To introduce the third person singular pronoun with the verb \"to be.\"","C.R./C.A.：能指认并描述人物；介绍第三人称单数代词搭配 be 动词。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Offering seats to others Declining offers Expressing insistence","让座给别人；婉拒别人的好意；表示坚持",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","vocabulary flashcards, adjective flashcards, coded messages, phonics flashcards","单词单词卡、形容词单词卡、密码信息、发音单词卡",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2/Classroom Activities 2B, Lesson 9","Classroom Readers 第 2 课／Classroom Activities 2B 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","school, Miss Brown, bus, man, woman, baby, Mr. Lee, Mrs. Lee",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","He/She/It is a/an _________________.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","n",null,1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 10","EEC 1 第 10 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pants, T-shirt, shoes, hat",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Have a seat, please.","A",1],["d","That's OK, I'll stand.","B",1],["d","I insist.","A",1],["d","Thank you very much.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Do the spelling Quiz in the Progress Report Book. Review the words in Class 11. You can review some words from Class 1-10.","1. 在学习进度手册上进行拼写小测验，复习第 11 课的单词，也可以复习第 1–10 课的一些单词。",0],["li","2. Spy Code game: Give each letter of the alphabet a number. For example, A=1, B=2, C=3 and so on. Before the class, prepare some coded messages. Explain the decoding method on the board to class. Divide the class into two teams. Teacher writes the coded messages on the board and the teams must figure out the messages. The first team to finish decoding a message gets a point.","2. 密码游戏：每个字母代表一个数字，例如 A=1、B=2、C=3 等。上课前先准备一些密码信息，在黑板上向全班说明解码方法。把全班分成两队，老师把密码信息写在黑板上，两队要解出信息，最先解出的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 2: It Is A School Bus (30 mins)","Classroom Readers 第 2 课 It Is A School Bus 这是校车（30 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review Mr., Mrs. and Miss. Write the teacher's first and last name on the board and then underneath, write your name, Mr./Mrs. and Miss (last/family name). Have the class repeat. For example, \"Miss Lin.\" Teacher says, \"I am Miss Lin.\" The students repeat, \"You are Miss Lin.\" Now go around the class introducing the girls first. Have the students say, \"I am Miss _________.\" And have everyone say , \"You are Miss ___________. Now introduce the boys in the same manner i.e., \"I am Mr. ______.\" You are Mr. _____________.\"","(1) 复习 Mr.、Mrs. 和 Miss。把老师的名和姓写在黑板上，下面写上您的称呼 Mr./Mrs./Miss（姓）。请全班复诵，例如 \"Miss Lin\"。老师说 \"I am Miss Lin.\"，学生复诵 \"You are Miss Lin.\"。接着先介绍班上的女生，请学生说 \"I am Miss ___.\"，全班一起说 \"You are Miss ___.\"；再用同样的方式介绍男生：\"I am Mr. ___.\" \"You are Mr. ___.\"",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words with phonics rules. But if there is no rule, you just tell them.","(2) 用自然拼读规则教新单词；没有规则的字直接告诉学生。",0],["d","s-s-s","T",0],["d","/s/, /s/, /s/","Ss",0],["d","c-c-c","T",0],["d","/c/, /c/, /c/","Ss",0],["d","h-h-h","T",0],["d","/w/, /w/, /w/","Ss",0],["d","But we can't say the sound like /ch/. So ch-ch-ch sounds like /c/, /c/, /c/","T",0],["d","/c/, /c/, /c/","Ss",0],["d","o-o-o","T",0],["d","/o/, /o/, /o/","S",0],["d","oo sounds like long /u/","T",0],["d","l-l-l","T",0],["d","/l/, /l/, /l/","S",0],["d","So /s/-/c/-/u/-/l/.","T",0],["d","/scul/.","Ss",0],["li","(3) Read the lesson word by word, sentence by sentence, then the whole page. Ask the students to repeat after you step by step.","(3) 一个字一个字、一句一句，再整页念课文，请学生一步一步跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(4) Show the content of this lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask the students to follow the dialogue, then the practicing part. Ask the students to play the dialogue step by step.","(4) 用触控一体机展示本课内容，请学生跟着对话念，再进行练习部分，请学生一步一步播放对话。",0],["li","(5) They should be familiar with the sentence patterns by now. Ask the students to draw someone or something on the board in turns. Make sentences like \"He/She is ______. He/She is a ______.\" Or \"It is a/an ______. It is a/an ______ ______.\"","(5) 学生现在应该已经熟悉这些句型。请学生轮流在黑板上画一个人或一样东西，并造句，例如 \"He/She is ___. He/She is a ___.\" 或 \"It is a/an ___. It is a/an ___ ___.\"",0],["li","(6) Q-A Ask the students to close the Readers. Teacher turns to page 23 \"Reviewing What We Know\", asks the students to stand up, then asks them to answer these questions. Those who answer the questions can sit down. The teacher can make up his own questions to ask them, but all these questions should be about Lesson 2.","(6) 问答：请学生合上读本。老师翻到第 23 页“Reviewing What We Know”，请学生站起来回答问题，答对的人可以坐下。老师也可以自己设计问题，但所有问题都要和第 2 课有关。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 9: It Is a School Bus (35 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 9 课 It Is a School Bus 这是校车（35 mins）",0],["h2","9.3",null,0],["p","Show the content of 9.3 using the touchscreen all-in-one. Say these \"N\" -sound words slowly and clearly. This sound is easily confused with \"M\". Repeat this a number of times. Ask each student to use the touchscreen all-in-one and say this sound after the touchscreen all-in-one.","用触控一体机展示 9.3 的内容。慢慢、清楚地念出这些“N”音的单词。这个音很容易和“M”混淆，多重复几次。请每位学生操作触控一体机，跟着触控一体机念这个音。",0],["h2","9.4",null,0],["li","1. Say each word once or twice and have your students make the appropriate response. After you've gone over the quiz, it's game time.","1. 每个单词念一到两次，请学生做出适当的反应。讲评完小测验后，就是游戏时间。",0],["li","2. Play the \"M\" and \"N\" game. Give each student a piece of paper. Tell the students to write M on one side and an N on the other. Teacher says a word. They all hold up the side that they think is the right sound. The side of the room with the most correct answers wins a point. If you want to make this more challenging, say the word quickly or say some words they never learned but have M/N.","2. 玩“M 和 N”游戏：发给每位学生一张纸，请学生在一面写 M、另一面写 N。老师说一个单词，学生举起他们认为正确的那一面。答对最多的那一边得一分。想增加挑战的话，可以把单词说快一点，或说一些学生没学过但含有 M/N 的字。",0],["h2","9.1",null,0],["p","Introduce the new words. Now, make some sentences with the pictures emphasizing the indefinite articles a/an.\" Have your students repeat these sentences to you. Use sentences like, \"He is a man. She is a woman. He is Mr. Lee. She is Mrs. Lee. It is a baby.\"","介绍新单词。接着用图片造句，强调不定冠词 a/an，请学生跟着您复诵这些句子，例如：\"He is a man. She is a woman. He is Mr. Lee. She is Mrs. Lee. It is a baby.\"",0],["h2","9.2 Waiting in Line","9.2 排队等候",0],["p","Have the students look at the people who are waiting in line. Tell your students who they are.","请学生看图中排队的人，告诉学生他们是谁。",0],["li","1. Part A: We're teaching them to write basic sentences in this exercise. Show this part on the touchscreen all-in-one. Find some students to type the answers. Check their answers with the touchscreen all-in-one. Now do some oral practice with each sentence.","1. A 部分：这个练习要教学生写基本的句子。在触控一体机上展示这部分，找几位学生输入答案，用触控一体机核对答案，再针对每个句子做口语练习。",0],["li","2. Part B: Have them identify a person or an object. Direct them to the example. Explain it to them and have them complete the rest of the exercises. Show the content of 9.2B using the touchscreen all-in-one. The exercise is easier than the book. Let the students play on the touchscreen all-in-one.","2. B 部分：请学生指认一个人或一样东西。引导他们看例题并加以说明，再请他们完成其余的练习。用触控一体机展示 9.2B 的内容，这个练习比课本简单，让学生在触控一体机上操作。",0],["li","3. In the back of Activities Book 2B on page 45, there are some cut-out words. In the remaining time have the students cut out some sentences. Make one sentence a question and one a statement. Walk around the class and help them construct correct sentences.","3. 在 Activities Book 2B 后面第 45 页有一些可以剪下的单词。利用剩下的时间请学生剪下一些句子，拼出一个问句和一个叙述句。在教室里走动，帮助学生组出正确的句子。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the monologue of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 of the monolog to the class. (See Below) Monolog What are the priority seats for on the bus? Will you offer the seat to others? Let's listen to the conversation.","老师让学生听本课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听（如下）。独白：What are the priority seats for on the bus? Will you offer the seat to others? Let's listen to the conversation.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog that they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. Teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialogue that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (Teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, Teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example and explain how to do the homework so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题说明作业的写法，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 6","电话教学教材 6",0],["d","Hello. How are you?","T",0],["d","Hello. Fine, thanks.","S",0],["d","Good. Make 2 sentences with \"I\".","T",0],["d","I am __________ (name). I am a __________ (girl/boy or student).","S",0],["d","Great! Make 2 sentences with \"you\".","T",0],["d","You are ____________ (name). You are a __________ (woman/man or teacher).","S",0],["d","Very good. Please make a sentence with \"student\".","T",0],["d","___________________________.","S",0],["d","Make a sentence with \"woman\".","T",0],["d","_________________________.","S",0],["d","Tell me four colors.","T",0],["d","red, blue, green, black","S",0],["d","Thank you. Goodbye.","T",0],["d","Bye-bye.","S",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers"]],[24,["Lesson 2","Learning & Playing"]],[47,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 9","9.3","9.4","9.1","9.2"]],[76,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["It Is A School Bus"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[48,49,50,51],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/C.A. To ask questions about objects To identify objects using it/this/that To ask and answer questions with \"what\"","C.R./C.A.：能询问有关物品的问题；能用 it/this/that 指认物品；能用 \"what\" 问答。",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","vocabulary flashcards, phonics flashcards, a big ball (to put under the shirt and pretend to be pregnant), a chair, pants, T-shirt, a pair of shoes, a hat, a CD player, a CD of dancing songs","单词单词卡、发音单词卡、一颗大球（塞在衣服下假装怀孕）、一张椅子、裤子、T 恤、一双鞋、一顶帽子、CD 播放器、舞曲 CD",1],["h3","Classroom Readers L3/Classroom Activities 2B, Lesson10","Classroom Readers 第 3 课／Classroom Activities 2B 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","see-saw, slide, bell, ball, toy, kite, doll, yo-yo",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","What is it/this/that? It/This/That is a/an .",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","h",null,1],["h3","EEC 1, Lesson 10","EEC 1 第 10 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","pants, T-shirt, shoes, hat",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Have a seat, please.","A",1],["d","That's OK. I'll stand.","B",1],["d","I insist.","A",1],["d","Thank you very much.","B",1],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","1. Do the spelling Quiz in the Progress Report Book. Review the words for Class 12. You can review some words from Class 1-11. Take this time to have a quick spelling quiz. Give them only 5-10 words.","1. 在学习进度手册上进行拼写小测验，复习第 12 课的单词，也可以复习第 1–11 课的一些单词。利用这段时间快速进行拼写小测验，只考 5–10 个字。",0],["li","2. Call out one of your student's names and have him spell a word. This is a good activity to reinforce their spelling abilities. Or do it like a relay race. Teacher says a word \"woman\", then points to S1,","2. 叫一位学生的名字，请他拼一个单词，这是加强拼写能力的好活动；也可以用接力赛的方式进行：老师说一个字 \"woman\"，再指 S1，",0],["d","\"w\" (T points to S2 quickly.)","S1",0],["d","\"o\" (T points to S3 quickly.)","S2",0],["d","\"m\" (T (points to S4 quickly.)","S3",0],["d","\"a\" (T (points to S5 quickly.)","S4",0],["d","\"n\" (The one can't answer will lose a point.)","S5",0],["p","Let all the students repeat \"w-o-m-a-n\" \"woman\".","请全班一起复诵 \"w-o-m-a-n\" \"woman\"。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 3: What Is It? (35 mins)","Classroom Readers 第 3 课 What Is It? 这是什么？（35 mins）",0],["li","(1) Go around the classroom pointing to objects and asking, \"What is it/this/that?\" \"This\" and \"that\" are easily confused. When pointing to a close object, really emphasize \"this\". The same goes for \"that\". \"It\" can be used in place of this or that.","(1) 在教室里指着物品问 \"What is it/this/that?\"。\"This\" 和 \"that\" 很容易混淆：指着近的物品时，特别强调 \"this\"；远的物品就强调 \"that\"。\"It\" 可以用来代替 this 或 that。",0],["li","(2) Teach the new words with phonics rules. But if there is no rule, you just tell them. Ask each student to say the words once, and then make sentences with these new words by him/herself. Example: This is a see-saw. It is a slide. That is a bell.","(2) 用自然拼读规则教新单词；没有规则的字直接告诉学生。请每位学生念一次单词，再自己用这些新单词造句，例如：This is a see-saw. It is a slide. That is a bell.",0],["li","(3) Read the lesson word by word, sentence by sentence, then the whole page. Ask the students to repeat after you step by step.","(3) 一个字一个字、一句一句，再整页念课文，请学生一步一步跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(4) Show the content of this lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one. Ask the students to follow the dialogue, then go into the practicing part. Ask the students to play the dialogue step by step.","(4) 用触控一体机展示本课内容，请学生跟着对话念，再进入练习部分，请学生一步一步播放对话。",0],["li","(5) Pair the students, then do the role-play with the flashcards.","(5) 让学生两两一组，用单词卡进行角色扮演。",0],["li","(6) Q-A Ask the students to close their Readers. Teacher turns to page 23, \"Reviewing What We Know\", asks the students to stand up, then asks them to answer the questions. Those who answer the questions can sit down. Teacher can make up their own questions to ask them, but all these questions should be about Lesson 3.","(6) 问答：请学生合上读本。老师翻到第 23 页“Reviewing What We Know”，请学生站起来回答问题，答对的人可以坐下。老师也可以自己设计问题，但所有问题都要和第 3 课有关。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 10: What Is It? (30 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 10 课 What Is It? 这是什么？（30 mins）",0],["h2","10.3",null,0],["p","Show the content of 10.3 using the touchscreen all-in-one. Say the \"h\" sound words slowly and clearly. Lead the students to say the chant of the letters, phonics, and the associated words. Repeat this a number of times. Ask each student to use the touchscreen all-in-one and say the sound after the touchscreen all-in-one.","用触控一体机展示 10.3 的内容。慢慢、清楚地念出“h”音的单词，带学生念字母、发音和相关单词的韵文，多重复几次。请每位学生操作触控一体机，跟着触控一体机念这个音。",0],["h2","10.4",null,0],["li","1. Say each word once or twice and have your students give the appropriate response. After you've gone over the quiz, it's game time.","1. 每个单词念一到两次，请学生做出适当的反应。讲评完小测验后，就是游戏时间。",0],["li","2. The Carrot Squat: Divide the class into 4 groups and give each group a name using the four new words:\"hamburger\",\" house\",\" happy\", \"hello\". Have all the studentsmake a circle in the middle of the classroom and stand in their own groups.","2. 萝卜蹲：把全班分成 4 组，用四个新单词为每组命名：\"hamburger\"、\"house\"、\"happy\"、\"hello\"。请所有学生在教室中间围成一圈，和自己的组员站在一起。",0],["d","House is here, house is here. H-H-H, /h/-/h/-/h/. Where is the \"hamburger\"?","G1",0],["d","Hamburger is here, hamburger is here. H-H-H, /h/-/h/-/h/. Where is \"happy\"?","G2",0],["p","G3 then G1/2/3/4. Repeat, playing it several times, until the students become familiar with the four main words.","……接着换 G3，再换 G1/2/3/4。重复玩几次，直到学生熟悉这四个主要单词。",0],["h2","10.1",null,0],["p","Teach the new words with phonics rules. But if there is no rule, you just tell them. Take the flashcards and place them in strategic places all over the room. Point at the cards and ask, \"What is this/that/it?\" Have a student answer using the correct sentence pattern.","用自然拼读规则教新单词；没有规则的字直接告诉学生。把单词卡放在教室各处适当的位置，指着卡片问 \"What is this/that/it?\"，请一位学生用正确的句型回答。",0],["h2","10.2",null,0],["li","1. Part A: It's an oral exercise. Say the sentence and have them repeat after you. The sentence relay game: Divide the students into two teams. The Teacher says a sentence and S1 from each team runs to the board and writes the first word of the sentence. They run back and give the marker to S2 who then writes the second word of the sentence. They must use correct grammar. The team that finishes first, wins. Show the content of 10.2A using the touchscreen all-in-one. It's a matching game. Let some students try to find the answers.","1. A 部分：这是口语练习。说出句子，请学生跟着您复诵。句子接力游戏：把学生分成两队，老师说一个句子，每队的 S1 跑到黑板前写下句子的第一个字，再跑回来把白板笔交给 S2，由 S2 写第二个字，语法必须正确，最先完成的队伍获胜。用触控一体机展示 10.2A 的内容，这是配对游戏，让几位学生试着找出答案。",0],["li","2. Part B: Activity Sheet 3:","2. B 部分：活动单 3：",0],["li","1. Have the students trace the words first. Then fill in 2 \"this\" and 2 \"that\" in the blanks of \"What is ?\"","1. 请学生先描写单词，再在 \"What is ___?\" 的空格中填入 2 个 \"this\" 和 2 个 \"that\"。",0],["li","2. Have the students point to any objects and ask their partners using \"What is this that?\"","2. 请学生指着任何物品，用 \"What is this/that?\" 问搭档。",0],["li","3. The students have to write down the answers while fininshing each dialogue.","3. 每完成一段对话，学生都要写下答案。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, teachers need to read the dialog to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the dialog script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念对话给学生听（对话稿请参考附录）；第 2 题则播放 MP3 给全班听。",0],["li","(1) Listen and label with the number 1, 2, or 3","(1) 听一听，标上数字 1、2 或 3",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the dialog to the students and have them listen to you and do the exercise. (Teacher can read the dialogue to the class again i necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students. Listen and label","念对话给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。听一听，标上名称",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monologue of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise. (See below.) Let's Check: Monolog There are many people on the bus. They are wearing different clothes. You see! What are they wearing? Please turn to page 42, Let's Check. Listen and label. Now let's practice the vocabulary.","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导（如下）。Let's Check 独白：There are many people on the bus. They are wearing different clothes. You see! What are they wearing? Please turn to page 42, Let's Check. Listen and label. Now let's practice the vocabulary.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers, and help them to correct their mistakes. (Teachers can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example to explain how to do the homework so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题说明作业的写法，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them to study for Test 2 in class 15 and bring the markers next time.","(3) 提醒学生准备第 15 课的测验 2，下次带彩笔。",0]],"g":[[36,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 10","Learning/ Playing","10.3","10.4","10.1","10.2"]],[73,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["What Is It?"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[52,53],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","Offering seats to others. Declining offers. Expressing insistence.","让座给别人；婉拒别人的好意；表示坚持",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Vocabulary flash cards, adjective flash cards, tape recorder, listening lab tape, number flashcards","单词单词卡、形容词单词卡、录音机、听力练习录音带、数字单词卡",0],["h3","Classroom Readers/Classroom Activities",null,0],["p","Classroom Readers Lesson 1-3 Classroom Activities Lesson 6-10","Classroom Readers 第 1–3 课；Classroom Activities 第 6–10 课",0],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 10","EEC 1 第 10 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","pants, T-shirt, shoes, hat",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","Have a seat, please.","A",0],["d","That's OK. I'll stand.","B",0],["d","I insist.","A",0],["d","Thank you very much.","B",0],["h2","Review (30 mins)","复习 Review（30 mins）",0],["p","Use this time for any catching up on any lessons that the students did not have time for in the previous lessons. If the students are caught up, then spend this time reviewing previous lessons or areas where students have had some difficulty. Use drills, games and activities for reviewing. Ask the students to use Digital Jordan to review all the lessons.","利用这段时间补上之前课程中，学生还没来得及完成的部分。如果学生进度都跟上了，就用这段时间复习之前的课程，或学生有困难的部分。用操练、游戏和活动来复习。请学生用 Digital Jordan 复习所有课程。",0],["h2","Quiz (25 mins)","小测验 Quiz（25 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put all their books and any other materials away. Hand out the quizzes. Make sure the students keep quiet as they do the quizzes.","请学生把所有书本和其他用品收起来，发下考卷。确认学生作答时保持安静。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (20 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（20 mins）",0],["p","After the break, get the students settled down and prepare them for the listening quiz. Play the tape for them and have them answer the questions. Try not to play the tape more than two times. After all, this is a listening quiz and we want to test their listening ability.","下课休息后，让学生安静下来，准备听力小测验。播放录音带请学生作答，尽量不要播放超过两次。毕竟这是听力小测验，我们要测验的是学生的听力。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for this unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and teachers need to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Review","1. 复习",0],["li","1. Review today's lesson (from Class 9-13) using the books.","1. 用课本复习今天的课程（第 9–13 课）。",0],["li","2. Review today's lesson (from Class 9-13) using the touchscreen all-in-one.","2. 用触控一体机复习今天的课程（第 9–13 课）。",0],["h3","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","1. Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","1. 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","2. Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","2. 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","3. Remind students that they will have Test 2 in class 15. They have to study hard for this.","3. 提醒学生第 15 课要考测验 2，必须好好准备。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 7","电话教学教材 7",0],["d","Hello.","T",0],["d","Hello.","S",0],["d","Please open your Classroom Activities book B to Lesson 10, page 14. Look at number 1.","T",0],["p","What is that?",null,0],["d","That is a ball.","S",0],["d","OK. Look at number 4. What is this?","T",0],["d","This is a doll.","S",0],["d","Good. Is Miss Brown a teacher?","T",0],["d","Yes, she is a teacher.","S",0],["d","Is Sam a girl?","T",0],["d","No, he is not a girl. He is a boy.","S",0],["d","Is Katie a girl?","T",0],["d","Yes, she is a girl.","S",0],["d","Are you a teacher?","T",0],["d","No, I'm not. I'm a student.","S",0],["d","Very good. Goodbye.","T",0],["d","Goodbye.","S",0]],"g":[[15,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Classroom Readers","Book 2","Lesson 1-3","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6-10"]],[29,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[54,55],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","Test, Review Classroom Readers & Classroom Activities","测验、复习 Classroom Readers 和 Classroom Activities",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","flashcards, the digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",0],["h3","Classroom Readers",null,0],["p","Lesson 1- Lesson3","第 1 课–第 3 课",0],["h3","Classroom Activities",null,0],["p","Lesson 6-Lesson 10","第 6 课–第 10 课",0],["h2","Review (15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["p","Take ten minutes to review for the test. Review the vocabulary and sentences by repeating after the touchscreen all-in-one according to the \"Digital Teaching Guide.\" Have students repeat the sentences once, and then try to spell the vocabulary or answer the questions which are related to the sentences.","花十分钟为测验做复习。依照“数字教学路径”跟着触控一体机复诵单词和句子。请学生把句子念一遍，再试着拼出单词或回答与句子相关的问题。",0],["h2","The Test (45 mins)","测验 The Test（45 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put any unnecessary material away before starting the test. Now hand out the test paper. The test will probably take the entire class. If the the students finish early, have them prepare for the oral test. Conduct the oral test outside of the classroom, individually, with the students. Each question is worth four points; one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation, and fluency. Give the students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor the student's behavior while you are out of the classroom or position yourself so you can observe the class through a window. The oral test is worth 20% of the test total. Bring a blank tape to the oral test and record the oral test. Listen to the tape later to know where the student needs help.","开始测验前，请学生把不需要的东西收起来，再发下考卷。测验大概会用掉整堂课；如果学生提早写完，请他们准备口语测验。在教室外个别进行口语测验，每题四分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各一分。先给学生改正自己错误的机会。您不在教室时，指定一位班长维持秩序，或站在可以从窗外观察班级的位置。口语测验占总成绩的 20%。准备一卷空白录音带录下口语测验，之后再听一次，了解学生需要加强哪些部分。",0],["h3","The Oral Test","口语测验题目",0],["h3","1. Is she Katie? (point to Katie)","1. Is she Katie?（指着 Katie）",0],["h3","2. What is it? (point to a doll)","2. What is it?（指着一个洋娃娃）",0],["h3","3. Is it a slide? (point to a see-saw)","3. Is it a slide?（指着跷跷板）",0],["h3","4. Are they friends?",null,0],["h3","5. Are you happy?",null,0],["h2","Game and Activity (30 mins)","游戏与活动 Game and Activity（30 mins）",0],["p","Get into Digital Teaching: Classroom Activities L10, 10.1 and 10.2 A. The Teacher points to the things on the monitor far away and ask the students,\"What is that?\" or point to the things on the monitor very close and ask the studens, \"What is this?\" For example:","进入数字教学：Classroom Activities 第 10 课的 10.1 和 10.2 A。老师指着屏幕上远处的东西问学生 \"What is that?\"，或指着屏幕上很近的东西问 \"What is this?\"。例如：",0],["p","T (Point to the kite): What is that?","T（指着风筝）：What is that?",0],["d","That is a kite.","Ss",0],["p","Then get into 10.2 A and lead the students in playing the matching game. Have any student come to the front and listen to the Teacher say any sentence on the monitor. Then click the picture and the correct sentence. For example:","接着进入 10.2 A，带学生玩配对游戏。请一位学生到前面，听老师说屏幕上的任一句子，再点击图片和正确的句子。例如：",0],["d","This is a slide.","T",0],["p","S (clicks the slide and the sentence \"This is a slide.\"): This is a slide. Students can get a reward card by doing well.","S（点击滑梯和句子 \"This is a slide.\"）：This is a slide. 表现好的学生可以得到一张奖励卡。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write\"test\"on the board and have the students write it down in their progress report books.","(1) 在黑板上写“Test”，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[9,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1-3","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6-10"]],[26,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":100},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[56,57],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To correct Test 2 To prepare for PTA Night To go on a field trip","订正测验 2；准备家长之夜；进行校外活动",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Field trip vocabulary flashcards (or pictures of new vocabulary), digital equipment","校外活动单词单词卡（或新单词的图片）、数字教学设备",0],["h2","Test Review (10 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（10 mins）",0],["p","Go over the test with the students, pointing out and correcting any mistakes they have made.","和学生一起讲评测验，指出并订正他们的错误。",0],["h2","Preparing For PTA Night (25 mins)","准备家长之夜 Preparing For PTA Night（25 mins）",0],["li","(1) Since Class 24 is a big day for teacher, parents and students, please see the lesson plan in this Manual or design another program. If you have decided to create your own program, it is best to choose a topic that the students have already studied.","(1) 第 24 课对老师、家长和学生来说都是大日子，请参考本手册的教案，或自己设计其他节目。如果决定自己设计节目，最好选择学生已经学过的主题。",0],["li","(2) Check the preparation schedule and make sure you have covered everything.","(2) 检查准备进度表，确认所有事项都已完成。",0],["li","(3) Have the students practice all of the program just like it's the real thing.","(3) 请学生像正式演出一样，把所有节目练习一遍。",0],["li","(4) Help the students to act naturally and to remember their lines while doing the stage performance.","(4) 帮助学生在舞台表演时表现自然、记住台词。",0],["h2","Field Trip Preparation (25 mins)","校外活动准备 Field Trip Preparation（25 mins）",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","tissue, candy, chewing gum, battery, comic book, telephone card, beverage, envelope, newspaper, magazine, toy.",null,0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","What is it? It is a/an ______________.",null,0],["li","1. The theme for this field trip is At The Supermarket. This will be very easy because we can see supermarkets everywhere. You might want to let the owner of the supermarket know that you are coming.","1. 这次校外活动的主题是“在超市（At The Supermarket）”。这很容易安排，因为超市到处都有。可以事先通知超市老板您们要去参观。",0],["li","2. The purpose of this field trip is to help the students buy daily products using English.","2. 这次校外活动的目的是帮助学生用英语购买日常用品。",0],["li","3. Teach them the new vocabulary and review the sentence patterns. Use a chain drill. Ask them what something is and have them reply using the sentence pattern. Repeat this procedure until they have a good grasp of it.","3. 教学生新单词并复习句型，用接龙练习：问学生某样东西是什么，请他们用句型回答。重复这个流程，直到学生能熟练掌握。",0],["li","4. Move them through the store in an orderly fashion.","4. 带学生有秩序地参观商店。",0],["h2","At The Supermarket (30 mins)","在超市 At The Supermarket（30 mins）",0],["li","1. Guide them in an orderly fashion through the supermarket. Point to various objects and ask your students what they are. Give out Dragon Baby cards to the students who answer the questions correctly.","1. 带学生有秩序地参观超市，指着各种物品问学生那是什么，答对的学生发给 Dragon Baby 卡。",0],["li","2. When they know everything there is to know about supermarkets, lead them back to the school. Review the vocabulary with them. The Teacher may give a \"pop\" quiz about the things they saw in the supermarket.","2. 学生认识超市里所有东西之后，带他们回到学校，和他们一起复习单词。老师可以针对在超市看到的东西进行“突击”小测验。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the vocabulary of the field trip.","(1) 复习校外活动的单词。",0],["h3","2-Progress Report Book","2. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress report book.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["h3","2-Evaluation Sheet","2. 评估表",0],["li","(1) Have the students open their books to the third evaluation sheet and explain how to use it.","(1) 请学生打开手册翻到第三张评估表，说明使用方法。",0],["li","(2) Have every student repeat each item with you. Try to make them understand the meaning.","(2) 请每位学生跟着您复诵每个项目，并尽量让他们了解意思。",0],["li","(3) Now ask the students to do it. If they have any question, help them right away.","(3) 接着请学生填写，有任何问题立即协助。",0],["li","(4) Record each student's scores of Quiz, Listening Lab, and Test in the correct column.","(4) 在正确的栏记录每位学生的小测验、听力练习和测验分数。",0],["li","(5) Check their progress report books individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(5) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(6) Telephone Teaching Reminder:","(6) 电话教学提醒：",0],["p","Have students write down the time of today's telephone teaching and tell them to stay home and wait for your call.","请学生写下今天电话教学的时间，并告诉他们在家等您的电话。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 8","电话教学教材 8",0],["d","Are you a baby?","T",0],["d","No, I'm not. I'm not a baby.","S",0],["d","Please open your Classroom Activities 2B to page 11. See 9.2(A), number 3. Is he a man?","T",0],["d","Yes, he is a man.","S",0],["d","Good! Please trun to page 14. Picture No.4, what is it?","T",0],["d","It is a doll.","S",0],["d","Very good. Please make a question with \"He.\"","T",0],["d","Is he a mailman?","S",0],["d","Great. See you.","T",0],["d","See you.","S",0]],"g":[[5,["None"]],[24,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[58,59,60,61],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. to ask and answer affirmative questions about others to identify musical instruments","C.R./C.A.：能用肯定句问答有关别人的问题；能说出乐器的名称。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Bidding others farewells Giving blessings","向别人道别；给予祝福",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","flashcards, the digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Reader, Lesson 4","Classroom Reader 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","classroom, too",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is he/she/it a _______? Yes, he/she/it is. He/She/it is a______.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2B, Lesson 11","Classroom Activities 2B 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","drum, piano, flute, violin",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is he/she/it a _______? Yes, he/she/it is. He/She/it is a______.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","r",null,1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 11","EEC 1 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","mittens, boots, scarf, coat, sweater",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","See you next time.","A",1],["d","Sure. Have a nice day.","B",1],["d","You, too. Bye!","A",1],["d","Goodbye!","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) It's a good time to review the test with the students. Show them the mistakes which most students made by writing them on the board. Have the students correct their mistakes.","(1) 这是和学生一起讲评测验的好时机。把大部分学生犯的错误写在黑板上，请学生订正自己的错误。",0],["li","(2) Review the previous lesson using Digital Teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(2) 用数字教学复习上一课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["li","(3) Ask them questions using the flashcards:","(3) 用单词卡问学生问题：",0],["p","T (point at a see-saw): What is it?","T（指着跷跷板）：What is it?",0],["d","It is a see-saw.","S",0],["li","(4) Make sure that everyone has an opportunity to review the vocabulary and the sentence pattern.","(4) 确认每个人都有机会复习单词和句型。",0],["li","(5) Spelling quiz: Have the students write down the vocabulary they hear.","(5) 拼写小测验：请学生写下听到的单词。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (15 mins) Lesson 4: In school","Classroom Readers（15 mins）第 4 课 In School 在学校",0],["li","(1) Show the situation which will be taught today on the monitor first.","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的情境。",0],["li","(2) And then introduce the vocabulary on the monitor.","(2) 接着在屏幕上介绍单词。",0],["d","(points at the classroom) classroom! Everybody, say \"classroom\"","T",0],["d","classroom.","Ss",0],["li","(3) Write the vocabulary on the board and spell it phonetically.","(3) 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读拼出来。",0],["d","oo, oo, /oo/, /oo/, /oo/ r/r/, oo /oo/, m/m/, room a/a/,ss/s/, ass/as/ l/l/, la/la/ c/c/, class","T",0],["li","(4) Keep introducing the vocabulary by pointing to the monitor, and have the students repeat after you.","(4) 继续指着屏幕介绍单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(5) Have the students listen to this lesson once, then move the cursor to the character.","(5) 让学生把这一课听一遍，再把游标移到角色上。",0],["d","What do you see in the touchscreen all-in-one?","T",0],["d","teacher (classroom, boy..)","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Point to the classroom ) This is a classroom. Is it a classroom?","T",0],["d","Yes, it is a classroom.","Ss",0],["li","(6) Press \"NEXT\" and divide the class into two teams. One stands for \"Kai\" and another stands for \"Sam.\" Practice the dialogue.","(6) 按“NEXT”，把全班分成两队，一队扮演“Kai”，另一队扮演“Sam”，练习对话。",0],["li","(7) Open book: Have the students open Classroom Reader to page 12 and repeat after the teacher.","(7) 打开课本：请学生打开 Classroom Reader 第 12 页，跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(8) Q & A: See Classroom Reader page 23. Ask the students some questions from the touchscreen all-in-one.","(8) 问与答：请看 Classroom Reader 第 23 页，用触控一体机中的题目问学生问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 11: In school (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 11 课 In School 在学校（25 mins）",0],["h2","11.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the view of the monitor to teach today's main sentences. Teach the students vocabulary by pointing to the touchscreen all-in-one, and have the students repeat after you.","(1) 用屏幕画面教今天的主要句型。指着触控一体机教学生单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(2) Teach body gestures of playing the drum, piano, flute and violin to the students and let them say the word while doing these gestures.","(2) 教学生打鼓、弹钢琴、吹长笛和拉小提琴的动作，请他们边做动作边说出单词。",0],["li","(3) Have the students listen to the vocabulary in the touchscreen all-in-one and spell each word phonetically.","(3) 请学生听触控一体机中的单词，用自然拼读拼出每个字。",0],["h3","Musical Instruments Game","乐器游戏",0],["li","(4) Review the gestures for various musical instruments and their English names.","(4) 复习各种乐器的动作和英文名称。",0],["li","(5) Divide the students into two teams and number them. When Teacher calls a number, the two students have to come to the board and listen:","(5) 把学生分成两队并编号。老师喊一个号码时，两位学生要到黑板前仔细听：",0],["p","T/Touchscreen all-in-one: flute The two students have to act out playing the \"flute\" and say \"flute\" The student who does it the fastest or most correctly is the winner.","T／触控一体机：flute。两位学生要做出吹“长笛”的动作并说 \"flute\"，最快或最正确的学生获胜。",0],["h2","11.2 -A",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to do vocal practice with these questions in the touchscreen all-in-one:","(1) 带学生用触控一体机中的这些问题进行口语练习：",0],["d","Is she a teacher?","T",0],["d","Yes, she is. She is a teacher.","S",0],["h3","Whispering Game","传话游戏",0],["li","(1) Divide the class into two lines. Teacher asks a question to the first student. Now have that one whisper to the next one until the last one gets the answer.","(1) 把全班分成两排，老师问第一位学生一个问题，请他小声传给下一位，一直传到最后一位知道答案。",0],["li","(2) Once the last one gets the answer, he/she has to go to the front and write the answer on the board.","(2) 最后一位知道答案后，要到前面把答案写在黑板上。",0],["li","(3) No matter who wins the game, the teacher has to lead the class to practice the sentences again.","(3) 不论哪一队获胜，老师都要带全班再练习一次句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 11: In School (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 11 课 In School 在学校（25 mins）",0],["h2","11.2-B:",null,0],["li","(1) Mark \"Q\" and \"A\" on the board and have two students stand either under \"Q\" or \"A\". Let them ask each other. S1(holds a flute flashcard): Is it a flute?","(1) 在黑板上标示“Q”和“A”，请两位学生分别站在“Q”或“A”下面互相问答。S1（拿着长笛单词卡）：Is it a flute?",0],["d","Yes, it is. It is a flute.","S2",0],["li","(2) After practicing two questions, have the student under \"A\" say the answer first. S1 (hold a \"teacher\" flashcard) : She is a teacher. And then have the studen under \"Q\" say the question.","(2) 练习两题后，请站在“A”下面的学生先说答案，S1（拿着“teacher”单词卡）：She is a teacher.，再请站在“Q”下面的学生说出问句。",0],["d","Is she a teacher?","S2",0],["li","(3) Have the students practice this sentence pattern following the steps above.","(3) 依照上面的步骤让学生练习这个句型。",0],["h2","11.3:",null,0],["li","(1) Show the view of the monitor to let the students listen to the four words.","(1) 播放屏幕画面，让学生听四个单词。",0],["li","(2) Have the students repeat after you about these four words.","(2) 请学生跟着您复诵这四个单词。",0],["li","(3) Let a student operate the touchscreen all-in-one and have the rest of the class repeat after him/ her.","(3) 请一位学生操作触控一体机，其他同学跟着他复诵。",0],["h2","11.4:",null,0],["li","(1) Have the class open Classroom Activities to page 21. Practice the \"r\" sound again.","(1) 请全班打开 Classroom Activities 第 21 页，再练习一次“r”的音。",0],["d","R,R,R, r, r, r.","T",0],["d","R, r, rabbit","S",0],["li","(2) The Teacher reads and the students check.","(2) 老师念，学生勾选。",0],["li","1. Teacher reads each picture, tells the students to put a tick on the square up in the right hand corner when they hear \"r\" sound.","1. 老师念出每张图片，告诉学生听到“r”的音时，在右上角的方格打钩。",0],["li","2. Move the page to 11.4 in the touchscreen all-in-one. Have the students listen to the touchscreen all-in-one and check their answers.","2. 把触控一体机翻到 11.4，请学生听触控一体机核对答案。",0],["li","(3) Open book:","(3) 打开课本：",0],["p","Have the students fill in the blanks in page 20 and listen to the touchscreen all-in-one to correct their answers.","请学生填写第 20 页的空格，再听触控一体机订正答案。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","Teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the monologue of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say It is evening right now. It's time to go home. What do you say to your friends or classmates? Let's listen!","老师让学生听本课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：It is evening right now. It's time to go home. What do you say to your friends or classmates? Let's listen!",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialogue that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (Teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with others. At this stage, Teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview the homework. Write a few examples on the board, so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers/","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1-3/ Lesson 6- 10"]],[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[34,["Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4"]],[51,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV"]],[51,["Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11","11.1","11.2-A"]],[68,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11","11.2-A/B","11.3","11.4"]],[104,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["In school"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[62,63,64,65,66],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To ask and answer questions about others in the negative To identify objects To ask and answer questions about people and things","C.R./C.A.：能用否定句问答有关别人的问题；能指认物品；能问答有关人和物的问题。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Bidding others farewell Giving blessings","向别人道别；给予祝福",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment, a ball","单词单词卡、数字教学设备、一颗球",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 5","Classroom Readers 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","driver, library, oh, my",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is he/she/it a/an __________? No, he/she/it is not.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2B Lesson 12","Classroom Activities 2B 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","office, desk, chair, picture, clock",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Is he/she/it a/an __________? No, he/she/it is not.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","l",null,1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 11","EEC 1 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","mittens, boots, scarf, coat, sweater",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","See you next time.","A",1],["d","Sure. Have a nice day.","B",1],["d","You, too. Bye!","A",1],["d","Goodbye!","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the words from the previous vocabulary using the touchscreen all-in-one or the flashcards.","(1) 用触控一体机或单词卡复习之前学过的单词。",0],["li","(2) Then review the \"Yes\" pattern with them. Go around the room asking questions like, Is she/he a student?\" and have them respond accordingly.","(2) 接着和学生复习“Yes”的句型，在教室里走动问 \"Is she/he a student?\" 等问题，请学生适当地回答。",0],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",0],["li","(4) After spelling quiz, teacher may have the students exchange their books to correct the answers right away.","(4) 拼写小测验后，老师可以请学生交换课本，立即订正答案。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 5: Is That A Student? (15 mins)","Classroom Readers 第 5 课 Is That A Student? 那是学生吗？（15 mins）",0],["h2","Learning:","学习（Learning）：",0],["li","(1) Show the situation which will be taught today on the monitor at first.","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的情境。",0],["li","(2) And then introduce the vocabulary on the monitor.","(2) 接着在屏幕上介绍单词。",0],["d","(point at the driver) driver! Everybody, say \"driver\"","T",0],["d","driver.","S",0],["li","(3)Write the vocabulary on the board and spell it phonetically.","(3) 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读拼出来。",0],["d","er, er, /er/, /er/, /er/ v/v/, ver, /ver/ r/r/,i/i/, ri/ri/ d/d/, driver","T",0],["li","(4) Keep introducing the vocabulary by pointing at the monitor and having the students repeat after you.","(4) 继续指着屏幕介绍单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(5) Have the students listen to this lesson once. Then move the cursor to the character. T(point at the nurse):Is she a nurse?","(5) 让学生把这一课听一遍，再把游标移到角色上。T（指着护士）：Is she a nurse?",0],["d","Yes, she is a nurse.","S",0],["li","(6) Press NEXT\" and ask the students,\"Is he a policeman?\"","(6) 按“NEXT”并问学生：\"Is he a policeman?\"",0],["d","No, he is not.","S",0],["p","He is a bus driver.",null,0],["li","(7) Open book: Have the students open their Classroom Readers to page 14 and repeat after the teacher.","(7) 打开课本：请学生打开 Classroom Readers 第 14 页，跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(8) Q & A: See Classroom Readers page 23, ask students some questions in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(8) 问与答：请看 Classroom Readers 第 23 页，用触控一体机中的题目问学生问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (25 mins) Lesson 13 Is That A Student?","Classroom Activities（25 mins）第 13 课 Is That A Student? 那是学生吗？",0],["h2","12.1",null,0],["li","(1) Use the compuer to teach today's main sentences.","(1) 用触控一体机教今天的主要句型。",0],["li","(2) Teach the students vocabulary by pointing to the touchscreen all-in-one and have the students repeat after you.","(2) 指着触控一体机教学生单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(3) Teach the vocabulary in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 用触控一体机教单词。",0],["li","(4) Have the students listen to the vocabulary in the touchscreen all-in-one and spell each word phonetically.","(4) 请学生听触控一体机中的单词，用自然拼读拼出每个字。",0],["d","ce, ce /ce/,/ce/,/ce/ i, i, i, /i/, /i/, /i/ f,f,/f/,/f/,/f/ office /ffice / o,o,o, /o/,/o/, /o/ office","T",0],["h3","Say Yes or No!","说 Yes 或 No！",0],["li","(1) Review the vocabulary.","(1) 复习单词。",0],["li","(2) The Teacher points to a picture then says its name. If the name is right, students have to say, Yes\", if not, students have to raise their hands and say,\" No!\" Then say its right name after that. T (Points to \"desk\"): chair.","(2) 老师指着一张图片说出名称。名称正确，学生就说 \"Yes\"；不正确，学生要举手说 \"No!\"，再说出正确的名称。T（指着“desk”）：chair.",0],["d","(raise their hands): No! desk.","Ss",0],["h2","12.2-A",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to do vocal practice with these questions in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 带学生用触控一体机中的这些问题进行口语练习。",0],["d","Is it a classroom?","T",0],["d","No, it is not. It is not a classroom. It is an office.","Ss",0],["li","(2) Teach this sentence pattern by singing:","(2) 用唱歌的方式教这个句型：",0],["d","(Two Tigers) 1231, 1231,345,345,565431,565431,151,151. .","Tune",0],["p","EX: Is it a classroom? Is it a classroom? (1231, 1231) No, it is not. No, it is not. (345,345) It's not a classroom. It's not a classroom. (565431,565431) It's an office. It's an office. (151,151). .",null,0],["h3","Yes No Hammer","Yes／No 锤子",0],["li","(1) Divide the class into two teams and number them.","(1) 把全班分成两队并编号。",0],["li","(2) Point to a picture in the touchscreen all-in-one and ask a question.","(2) 指着触控一体机中的一张图片问一个问题。",0],["li","(3) Call a number. The two students have to grab either \"Yes\" or \"No\" hammer according to the answer.","(3) 喊一个号码，两位学生要依照答案抢“Yes”或“No”锤子。",0],["li","(4) They have to say the answer no matter if they grab the hammer or not. See who says the right answer. He is the winner.","(4) 不论有没有抢到锤子，都要说出答案，说对答案的人获胜。",0],["h2","12.2-B",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 12.2 and have the students appreciate the animation on the monitor.","(1) 进入 12.2 页，让学生欣赏屏幕上的动画。",0],["li","(2) Have the students repeat after you while presenting the animation on the monitor.","(2) 播放屏幕上的动画时，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(3) Introduce the picture on the monitor and move the cursor to \"?\" to show the picture. Then ask the students questions about the picture. EXAMPLE:","(3) 介绍屏幕上的图片，把游标移到“?”显示图片，再针对图片问学生问题。例如：",0],["d","Is it a picture?","T",0],["d","No, it is not. It is not a picture.","S",0],["p","After the students answer, click on \"?\" and the answers will be shown on the monitor or have some students type the answers in the touchscreen all-in-one.","学生回答后，点击“?”让答案显示在屏幕上，或请几位学生在触控一体机上输入答案。",0],["li","(4) Students get Activity Sheet 4","(4) 发给学生活动单 4。",0],["li","1. Have the students draw a picture in the square.","1. 请学生在方格中画一张图。",0],["li","2. Let the students cover the picture they drew and walk around the classroom to guess what their classmates drew by saying, \"Is it a/an ?\"","2. 请学生遮住自己画的图，在教室里走动，用 \"Is it a/an ___?\" 猜同学画了什么。",0],["li","3. If they can't get the right answer after 5 tries by asking a person, they will draw a \"hang man,\" then keep asking.","3. 如果问同一个人 5 次还猜不到，就画一个“吊人”，再继续问。",0],["li","4. When the students get the right answer, they are able to write down the answer.","4. 猜对后，学生就可以写下答案。",0],["li","5. See who can finish the sheet fastest. He is the winner.","5. 最快完成活动单的人获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 12: Is That A Student? (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 12 课 Is That A Student? 那是学生吗？（25 mins）",0],["h2","12.3",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 12.3","(1) 进入 12.3 页。",0],["li","(2) Then have some students go to the front to click on the words.","(2) 请几位学生到前面点击单词。",0],["d","Do you see \"L\"? Please click it and say it with the touchscreen all-in-one.","T",0],["p","EX:","例如：",0],["p","S (clicks lion):lion","S（点击 lion）：lion",0],["d","Everybody say, \"lion\".","T",0],["li","(3) Have students repeat after you again.","(3) 请学生再跟着您复诵一次。",0],["h2","12.4",null,0],["li","(1) Have the class open Classroom Activities to page 25. Review the \"l\" sound .","(1) 请全班打开 Classroom Activities 第 25 页，复习“l”的音。",0],["d","L,L,L, l,l,l","T",0],["d","L, l, lion.","Ss",0],["li","(2) The teacher reads and the students check.","(2) 老师念，学生勾选。",0],["li","1. The teacher reads each picture and tells the students to put a tick on the squareup in the right hand corner when they hear \"l\" sound.","1. 老师念出每张图片，告诉学生听到“l”的音时，在右上角的方格打钩。",0],["li","2. Move the page to 12.4 in the touchscreen all-in-one. Have the students listen to the touchscreen all-in-one and check their answers.","2. 把触控一体机翻到 12.4，请学生听触控一体机核对答案。",0],["li","(3) Open book:","(3) 打开课本：",0],["li","1. Have the students open their books to page 24.","1. 请学生打开课本第 24 页。",0],["li","2. Divide the students into three groups and fill in the blanks individually. EX:","2. 把学生分成三组，各自填写空格。例如：",0],["p","Group 1 finishes question 1-2, Group 2 finishes question 3-4, and Group 3 finishes question 4-5.","第 1 组完成第 1–2 题，第 2 组完成第 3–4 题，第 3 组完成第 4–5 题。",0],["li","3. Listen to the touchscreen all-in-one to correct the answers.","3. 听触控一体机订正答案。",0],["h2","12.5-A",null,0],["p","Enter page 12.5-A in the touchscreen all-in-one. Pick one student each time to type the right answer.","进入触控一体机的 12.5-A 页，每次挑一位学生输入正确答案。",0],["h2","12.5-B",null,0],["p","Enter page 12.5-B in the touchscreen all-in-one. Do \"Ball Drill\" with the students to practice the sentences.","进入触控一体机的 12.5-B 页，和学生进行“传球练习”练习句子。",0],["h2","12.5-C",null,0],["p","Have the students open the book to page 26 and look at it for about 30 seconds. Then enter page 12.5-C in the touchscreen all-in-one and have a student check the answers in the touchscreen all-in-one.","请学生打开课本第 26 页看大约 30 秒，再进入触控一体机的 12.5-C 页，请一位学生在触控一体机上核对答案。",0],["h2","12.5-D",null,0],["p","Have the students fill in the blanks in page 27, then go to 12.5-D in the touchscreen all-in-one to practice with it.","请学生填写第 27 页的空格，再到触控一体机的 12.5-D 页练习。",0],["h2","12.5-E",null,0],["p","Enter page 12.5-E in the touchscreen all-in-one. Let three students try to put the first letter in each blank.","进入触控一体机的 12.5-E 页，让三位学生试着在每个空格中填入第一个字母。",0],["h2","12.6-A",null,0],["p","Review the \"m\", \"n\",\"h\", \"l\" and \"r\" sounds. Have the students repeat after the teacher about the pictures.","复习“m”“n”“h”“l”“r”的音，请学生跟着老师念图片。",0],["h2","12.6-B",null,0],["p","Have the students open their books to page 28 and listen to the teacher saying the words. After finishing the exercise, go to the touchscreen all-in-one, check the answer, and repeat.","请学生打开课本第 28 页，听老师念单词。完成练习后，到触控一体机核对答案并复诵。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, teachers need to read the dialog to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the dialog script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念对话给学生听（对话稿请参考附录）；第 2 题则播放 MP3 给全班听。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and label with the number 1, 2, or 3","(1) 听一听，标上数字 1、2 或 3",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the dialog to the students and have them listen to you and do the exercise. (Teacher can read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念对话给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["li","(2) Listen to the words and connect them with a line.","(2) 听单词，用线连起来。",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the Let's Check monolog. Let's Check Monolog:","播放“Let's Check”独白。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","It's very cold in the winter. What do people wear? Please turn to page 46, Let's Check. Listen to the words and connect them with a line. Let's practice the words together.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (Teacher can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books. ●Follow","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board, so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind students to bring markers next class.","(3) 提醒学生下次上课带彩笔。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 9","电话教学教材 9",0],["d","Hello. How are you?","T",0],["d","Fine, thanks. And you?","S",0],["d","Good. Please open Classroom Activities to page 21.11.3, No.1.","T",0],["d","Is it a tiger?","T",0],["d","No, it is not. It is a rabbit.","S",0],["d","Good. Please turn to page 23, No. 2. Is she a nurse?","T",0],["d","Yes, she is. She is a nurse.","S",0],["d","Very good. Look at page 22. Make a sentence with \"desk\".","T",0],["d","___________________.","S",0],["d","Good. Is your desk small?","T",0],["d","_______________________.","S",0],["d","Please take out Classroom Readers and turn to page 14.","T",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11"]],[32,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 5"]],[48,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 12","12.1","12.2-A/B","12.3","12.4","12.5","12.6"]],[141,["the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Is That A Student?"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[67,68,69,70],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R/C.A To ask and answer the questions about age and nationality","C.R./C.A.：能问答有关年龄和国籍的问题。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Bidding others farewells Giving blessings","向别人道别；给予祝福",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","flashcards, the digital equipment, copies of four national flags","单词卡、数字教学设备、四个国家国旗的复印件",1],["h3","Classroom Readers, Lesson 6","Classroom Readers 第 6 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Chinese, eleven",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are you a/an ________? Yes, I am. No, I am not. Am I _______? Yes, I am. No, I am not.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2B, Lesson 13","Classroom Activities 2B 第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","American, Chinese, Japanese, Mexican",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are you a/an ________? Yes, I am./No, I am not. Am I _______? Yes, you are. /No, you are not.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","ch",null,1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 11","EEC 1 第 11 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","mittens, boots, scarf, coat, sweater",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","See you next time.","A",1],["d","Sure. Have a nice day.","B",1],["d","You, too. Bye!","A",1],["d","Goodbye!","B",1],["li","(1) Review the last class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(1) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",1],["li","(2) Make your way from \"elephant\" to \"eraser\":","(2) 从“elephant”接到“eraser”：",1],["p","elephant eraser Have the students figure out the vocabulary in the three blanks above. The first letter must be same as the last letter of the previous word. (ANS: elephant, toy, yo-yo, office, eraser)","elephant ___ ___ ___ eraser。请学生想出上面三个空格的单词，每个字的第一个字母必须和前一个字的最后一个字母相同。（答案：elephant, toy, yo-yo, office, eraser）",1],["li","(3) Spelling quiz.","(3) 拼写小测验。",1],["li","(4) After the students turn in/exchange their Progress Report Books, have volunteers write down the answers on the board.","(4) 学生缴交／交换学习进度手册后，请自愿的学生把答案写在黑板上。",1],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 6: Are You Chinese? (15 mins)","Classroom Readers 第 6 课 Are You Chinese? 你是中国人吗？（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) Show the situation which will be taught today on the monitor.","(1) 在屏幕上展示今天要教的情境。",0],["li","(2) Now introduce the vocabulary on the monitor.","(2) 接着在屏幕上介绍单词。",0],["d","(points to Kai) Kai! Kai is Chinese. Everybody, say \"Kai is Chinese\".","T",0],["d","Kai is Chinese.","Ss",0],["li","(3) Write the vocabulary on the board and spell it phonetically.","(3) 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读拼出来。",0],["d","nese, / nese / i,i,i,/i/,/i/,/i/ ch, ch, /ch/,/ch/,/ch/ Chinese","T",0],["li","(4) Keep introducing the vocabulary by pointing to the monitor and have students repeat after you.","(4) 继续指着屏幕介绍单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(5) Have students listen to this lesson one time. Then move the cursor to the characters. T (points at Charlie):Is he Kai?","(5) 让学生把这一课听一遍，再把游标移到角色上。T（指着 Charlie）：Is he Kai?",0],["d","No.","Ss",0],["d","Is Kai ten?","T",0],["d","No, he is not","Ss",0],["li","(6) Press \"NEXT\" and divide the class into four teams: They are Miss Brown, Kai, Charlie and Kim. The teacher operates the touchscreen all-in-one and has the students guess who will speak next.","(6) 按“NEXT”，把全班分成四队，分别扮演 Miss Brown、Kai、Charlie 和 Kim。老师操作触控一体机，让学生猜接下来谁会说话。",0],["li","(7) Open book: Have the students open their Classroom Readers to page 16 and repeat after teacher.","(7) 打开课本：请学生打开 Classroom Readers 第 16 页，跟着老师复诵。",0],["li","(8) Q &A: See \"Classroom Readers\" page 23, ask the students some questions in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(8) 问与答：请看 Classroom Readers 第 23 页，用触控一体机中的题目问学生问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (25 mins) Lesson 13 Are you Chinese?","Classroom Activities（25 mins）第 13 课 Are You Chinese? 你是中国人吗？",0],["h2","13.1",null,0],["li","(1) Show the view of the monitor to teach today's main sentences.","(1) 用屏幕画面教今天的主要句型。",0],["li","(2) Teach the students vocabulary by pointing the touchscreen all-in-one and have the students repeat after you.","(2) 指着触控一体机教学生单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(3) Teach the vocabulary in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(3) 用触控一体机教单词。",0],["li","(4) Have the students listen to the vocabulary in the touchscreen all-in-one and spell each word phonetically.","(4) 请学生听触控一体机中的单词，用自然拼读拼出每个字。",0],["d","c,c,c, /c/, /c /, /c / an, an, an, /an/, /an/, /an/ can, /can/ ri,ri /ri /, /ri/, /ri/ rican-/rican/ me, me/me//me//me/ merican-/merican/ American-/American/","T",0],["li","(5) Let the students draw something to symbolize that nationality.","(5) 请学生画一样能代表这个国籍的东西。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 13: Are you Chinese?","Classroom Activities 第 13 课 Are You Chinese? 你是中国人吗？",0],["h3","(40 mins)","（40 mins）",0],["p","Activity: Is he American?","活动：Is he American?",0],["li","(1) Review the vocabulary.","(1) 复习单词。",0],["li","(2) Divide the class into two teams. Two players come to the front of the class and face the rest of the seated students.","(2) 把全班分成两队，两位玩家到教室前面，面向坐着的其他学生。",0],["li","(3) Each player should have a marker. The teacher shows a nationality flashcard and asks, \"Is he/she American?\"","(3) 每位玩家拿一支白板笔。老师拿出一张国籍单词卡问：\"Is he/she American?\"",0],["li","(4) The two players have to draw something related to the flashcard they see. The first one to finish drawing gets a chance to answer the question. If the question is answered correctly, their team gets two points and the second one to answer gets one point.","(4) 两位玩家要画出和单词卡有关的东西，最先画完的人有机会回答问题。答对的话，该队得两分；第二位答对的人得一分。",0],["d","Are you Chinese?","T",0],["p","S1,S2 (Draws something/someone Chinese): Yes, I am. I am Chinese.","S1、S2（画出和中国有关的东西或人）：Yes, I am. I am Chinese.",0],["h3","(5) Activity Sheet 5 ","(5) 活动单 5",0],["li","1. Have the students choose a nationality and fill in the blank of \"I am .\"","1. 请学生选一个国籍，填入 \"I am ___.\" 的空格。",0],["li","2. Lead the students to write down each nationality in the blank below then ask to other classmates, \"Are you Chinese/ American/ Japanese/ Mexican?\"","2. 带学生在下面的空格写出每个国籍，再问其他同学：\"Are you Chinese/American/Japanese/Mexican?\"",0],["li","3. Check the squares according to their partners' answers.","3. 依照搭档的回答在方格打钩。",0],["h2","13.2-A",null,0],["li","(1) Lead the students to do vocal practice with these questions in the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 带学生用触控一体机中的这些问题进行口语练习。",0],["h2","13.2-B",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 13.2 to introduce the pictures on the monitor and have the students repeat after it.","(1) 进入 13.2 页介绍屏幕上的图片，请学生跟着复诵。",0],["li","(2) Copy the flags from the touchscreen all-in-one and teach them greetings in different languages. as you show the flags. For example: The Teacher raises the Chinese flag and says, \"Nin-how,\"then ask them, \"Am I Chinese?\" Students have to answer \"Yes, you are. You are Chinese.\" or \"No, you are not. You are not Chinese.\"","(2) 从触控一体机复制国旗，展示国旗时教学生不同语言的问候语。例如：老师举起中国国旗说“您好”，再问学生 \"Am I Chinese?\"，学生要回答 \"Yes, you are. You are Chinese.\" 或 \"No, you are not. You are not Chinese.\"",0],["h2","13.3",null,0],["li","(1) Review the sound of \"ch\" before using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 使用触控一体机前，先复习“ch”的音。",0],["li","(2) Have the students listen to the touchscreen all-in-one telling the sound of each picture.","(2) 请学生听触控一体机念出每张图片的音。",0],["h2","13.4",null,0],["li","(1) Have the class open Classroom Activities to page 33. Review the \"ch\" sound .","(1) 请全班打开 Classroom Activities 第 33 页，复习“ch”的音。",0],["d","ch,ch,ch,","T",0],["d","/ch/, /ch/, /ch/","Ss",0],["h3","(2) The teacher reads and students check","(2) 老师念，学生勾选。",0],["li","1. The teacher reads each picture and has the students put a tick on the square in the upper right corner when they hear the \"ch\" sound.","1. 老师念出每张图片，请学生听到“ch”的音时，在右上角的方格打钩。",0],["li","2. Move the page to 13.4 in the touchscreen all-in-one. Have the students listen to the touchscreen all-in-one and check their answers.","2. 把触控一体机翻到 13.4，请学生听触控一体机核对答案。",0],["li","(3) Open Book: Have the students open their books to page 31 and page 32 and practice what they have learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the words and sentences.","(3) 打开课本：请学生打开课本第 31、32 页练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词和句子。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I Do?",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog for this unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front of the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview the students' homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习学生的作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress report books.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and give each student some comments or encouragement. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[0,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 12"]],[31,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6"]],[47,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","Learning","Playing","13.1"]],[54,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13","Part 2","13.2","Part 2","13.3(A)","Part 2","13.3(B)"]],[91,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Are You Chinese?"],"bd":"","m":65},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[71,72,73,74,75],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.R/C.A",null,1],["p","To answer questions about groups of two or more To describe physical appearance and express emotions To make sentences using second and third person plurals","能回答有关两人以上群体的问题；能描述外表和表达情绪；能用第二、第三人称复数造句。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Asking permission to be let in Asking for identities Expressing welcome Extending invitations to others to enter","请求别人让自己进去；询问身份；表示欢迎；邀请别人进来",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","flashcards, the digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 7","Classroom Readers 第 7 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","classmate, happy, meet",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","We are________. They are .",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 2B, Lesson 14","Classroom Activities 2B 第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","hungry, thirsty, hot, cold, full",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","We/You/They are ________.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","Final \"s\"","词尾“s”",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 12","EEC 1 第 12 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","purse, socks, shorts, skirt",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","(cid:0)knock/ knock/ knock(cid:0)","A",1],["d","Who's there?","B",1],["d","It's Bob and Mary","A",1],["d","Hello, there. Come in.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the lesson using the Ball Drill:","(1) 用传球练习复习课程：",0],["p","Have all the students stand up and get the ball from you to answer the questions from the previous lessons. Students who answer correctly can sit down. The person still standing at the end should come to the front and draw one of the nationalities. The class has to figure out what nationality he/she drew, then the student can go back to his/her seat.","请所有学生站起来，接到您的球就要回答之前课程的问题，答对的人可以坐下。最后还站着的人要到前面画出一个国籍，全班要猜出他画的是哪个国籍，猜出后他才能回到座位。",0],["li","(2) Review the last class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences. Review and ask the students about the colors on the monitor. T (point at something green): What color is it?","(2) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。复习并问学生屏幕上的颜色。T（指着绿色的东西）：What color is it?",0],["d","It's green.","Ss",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 7: New Friends (15 mins)","Classroom Readers 第 7 课 New Friends 新朋友（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) First, show the situation which will be taught today on the monitor.","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的情境。",0],["li","(2) Then introduce the vocabulary.","(2) 接着介绍单词。",0],["d","(point to a student in the classroom) May! May is your classmate. Everybody, say \"classmate.\"","T",0],["d","Classmate.","Ss",0],["p","Have another student (Jason) come to the front. Tell the class, \"He is your classmate, too.\"","请另一位学生（Jason）到前面，告诉全班：\"He is your classmate, too.\"",0],["li","(3) Write the vocabulary on the board and spell it phonetically.","(3) 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读拼出来。",0],["d","a-e, / a-e /,/ a-e /,/ a-e / mate /mate/ s, s, /s/,/s/,/s/ a,a /a//a//a/ las /las/ class /class/ classmate /classmate/","T",0],["li","(4) Keep introducing the vocabulary by pointing at the monitor, and have the students repeat after you.","(4) 继续指着屏幕介绍单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(5) Have the students listen to the lesson once. Then move the cursor to the characters. T (points at Kai): He is a new student. Kim is telling Kai about the other classmates' names. T (points at Kim): What is her name?","(5) 让学生把这一课听一遍，再把游标移到角色上。T（指着 Kai）：He is a new student. Kim 正在告诉 Kai 其他同学的名字。T（指着 Kim）：What is her name?",0],["d","Kim.","Ss",0],["d","Very good.","T",0],["li","(6) The Teacher and the students role play with the touchscreen all-in-one:","(6) 老师和学生跟着触控一体机进行角色扮演：",0],["p","The teacher is Kim. Have three students be Katie, Charlie and Sam. They stand by you. The teacher has to introduce the three students to the class. T (points to himself): I am Kim. T (points to Katie): We are Kim and Katie. T (points to Charlie and Sam): They are Charlie and Sam. T (points to Katie, Charlie and Sam): We are students. We are classmates. We are happy to meet you. Press \"NEXT,\" and have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","老师扮演 Kim，请三位学生扮演 Katie、Charlie 和 Sam，站在您旁边。老师要向全班介绍这三位学生。T（指着自己）：I am Kim. T（指着 Katie）：We are Kim and Katie. T（指着 Charlie 和 Sam）：They are Charlie and Sam. T（指着 Katie、Charlie 和 Sam）：We are students. We are classmates. We are happy to meet you. 按“NEXT”，请学生跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["li","(7) Open book: Have the students open Classroom Reader to page 18 and let them practice reading individually.","(7) 打开课本：请学生打开 Classroom Reader 第 18 页，让他们个别练习朗读。",0],["li","(8) Q & A: See Classroom Reader, page 23. Ask the students some questions from the touchscreen all-in-one.","(8) 问与答：请看 Classroom Reader 第 23 页，用触控一体机中的题目问学生问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 14: New Friends (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 14 课 New Friends 新朋友（25 mins）",0],["h2","14.1",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to teach today's lesson.","(1) 用触控一体机教今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Let the students repeat the vocabulary after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请学生跟着触控一体机复诵单词。",0],["li","(3) Point to the picture and tell the students about the situation in the restaurant. T (Points to Katie and Kim): They are cold.","(3) 指着图片，告诉学生餐厅里的情境。T（指着 Katie 和 Kim）：They are cold.",0],["d","Are they cold?","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are cold.","Ss",0],["p","Follow this style and teach feelings. Have the students make sentences using second and third person plurals.","用这种方式教各种感受，请学生用第二、第三人称复数造句。",0],["li","(4) Teach the students to act out feelings.","(4) 教学生用动作表现各种感受。",0],["h3","Mime Game","比手画脚游戏",0],["li","(1) Review the gestures for feelings.","(1) 复习表达感受的动作。",0],["li","(2) Divide the students into two teams and take turns guessing what feelings the students are miming.","(2) 把学生分成两队，轮流猜学生表演的是什么感受。",0],["li","(3) Have any two students come to the front and tell them to act as you order. (For example, cold.)","(3) 请任两位学生到前面，依照您的指示表演（例如：cold）。",0],["li","(4) The teacher asks, \"Are they hungry?\" The students have to raise their hands to answer the questions depending on the actions.","(4) 老师问：\"Are they hungry?\" 学生要依照表演的动作举手回答问题。",0],["d","Are they hungry?","T",0],["d","No, they are not. They are not hungry. (They are cold.)","S",0],["li","(5) Open Book: Have the students open their books and repeat the vocabulary after you.","(5) 打开课本：请学生打开课本，跟着您复诵单词。",0],["h2","14.2",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 14.2 and have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 进入 14.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["li","(2) Take out Activity Sheet 6:","(2) 拿出活动单 6：",0],["p","Have the students draw themselves and one of their classmates in the square. Complete the sentences for picture A then read the sentences to any other classmate. The students have to draw the picture and write down the sentences they've heard from their partners on Side B .","请学生在方格中画出自己和一位同学，完成 A 图的句子，再把句子念给其他任一位同学听。学生要在 B 面画出听到的内容，并写下从搭档那里听到的句子。",0],["li","(3) Open Book: Have the students open their books to page 34 and 35 and repeat after the teacher.","(3) 打开课本：请学生打开课本第 34、35 页，跟着老师复诵。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 14: New Friends (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 14 课 New Friends 新朋友（25 mins）",0],["h2","14.3",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 14.3 and have the students listen to the touchscreen all-in-one once. Then, they open their books and practice writing the answers.","(1) 进入 14.3 页，请学生听触控一体机念一次，再打开课本练习写答案。",0],["li","(2) Divide the students into four groups and number them from one to four. Have someone from each group stand and read the sentences he wrote.","(2) 把学生分成四组，编号一到四，请每组派一人站起来念出自己写的句子。",0],["h2","14.4",null,0],["li","(1) Let the students watch the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sounds.","(1) 让学生看触控一体机并复诵这些音。",0],["li","(2) It is better to practice the same pronunciation and then the others.","(2) 最好先练习相同的发音，再练习其他的。",0],["li","(3) Tell the students that the words on the left side are pronounced differently from those on the right side.","(3) 告诉学生左边的单词和右边的单词发音不同。",0],["h2","14.5",null,0],["li","(1) Review the final \"s\" sound. The teacher reads. The students listen and put a check in the square below if the two words have the same final \"s\" sound.","(1) 复习词尾“s”的音。老师念，学生听，如果两个字的词尾“s”音相同，就在下面的方格打钩。",0],["li","(2) Let the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one once.","(2) 请学生跟着触控一体机复诵一次。",0],["li","(3) Check the answers and reinforce the final \"s\" sound.","(3) 核对答案，加强词尾“s”的音。",0],["li","(4) Open Book:","(4) 打开课本：",0],["p","Have the students open their books to page 37 and practice the final \"s\" sound.","请学生打开课本第 37 页，练习词尾“s”的音。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\"","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。",0],["h3","Let's See And Say",null,0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students listen to the monologue of Let's See and Say section in lesson one. Teacher can read or play the MP3 of the monolog. Let's See & Say: Monolog It's fun to visit our friends. We can play and chat together. Now, let's visit a friend.","老师让学生听本课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听。Let's See & Say 独白：It's fun to visit our friends. We can play and chat together. Now, let's visit a friend.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just heard. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialogue for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialogue that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply this type of conversation in real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so that they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind the students that there is a telephone teaching today, and preview the questions.","(3) 提醒学生今天有电话教学，并预习题目。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 10","电话教学教材 10",0],["d","Hello, how are you?","T",0],["d","Fine, thanks.","S",0],["d","Good. Please open your Classroom Activities to page 35, Picture 1.","T",0],["d","Are they students?","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are students.","S",0],["d","Picture 3. Are they students?","T",0],["d","No, they are not. They are not students. They are teachers.","S",0],["d","Picture 4. Are they hungry?","T",0],["d","No, they are not. They are not hungry. They are full.","S",0],["d","Very good. Goodbye.","T",0],["d","Bye-bye.","S",0]],"g":[[27,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 13"]],[32,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14","Learning","Playing","14.1"]],[49,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14","14.1","14.2","14.3","14.4","14.5"]],[101,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["New Friends"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[76,77,78,79],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/.C.A. To ask and answer questions about groups of two or more To describe physical appearance and express emotions To ask questions using second and third person plurals","C.R./C.A.：能问答有关两人以上群体的问题；能描述外表和表达情绪；能用第二、第三人称复数提问。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Asking permission to be let in Asking for identities Expressing welcome Extending invitations to others to enter","请求别人让自己进去；询问身份；表示欢迎；邀请别人进来",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","vocabulary flashcards, the digital equipment","单词单词卡、数字教学设备",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 8","Classroom Readers 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","test, ready, hurry up, sorry,",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are you (adj.)? Yes,we are/ I am______. No,we are/ I am not ______.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities, Lesson 15","Classroom Activities 第 15 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","old, young, sad, bad, angry",null,1],["h3","Sentence Pattern","句型",1],["p","Are you/we/they (adj.)? Yes, ______. No, ______.",null,1],["h3","Phonics","自然拼读",1],["p","final \" es\"","词尾“es”",1],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 12","EEC 1 第 12 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","purse, socks, shorts, skirt",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","(cid:0)knock/ knock/ knock(cid:0)","A",1],["d","Who's there?","B",1],["d","It's Bob and Mary","A",1],["d","Hello, there. Come in.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the lesson using a chain drill:","(1) 用接龙练习复习课程：",0],["li","1. Show the flashcards of the last lesson to the students and have them repeat once.","1. 拿出上一课的单词卡给学生看，请他们复诵一次。",0],["li","2. Divide the class into two lines and number them.","2. 把全班分成两排并编号。",0],["li","3. The teacher shows two flashcards to the class and passes each one to the first students in line one and line two.","3. 老师拿出两张单词卡给全班看，分别交给第一排和第二排的第一位学生。",0],["li","4. At the signal, the students have to pass the flashcards one after one and say the word, until the last one gets the flashcard. Then he/she has to go to the front and say the word loudly.","4. 听到信号后，学生要一个接一个传单词卡并说出单词，直到最后一位拿到单词卡，再到前面大声说出这个字。",0],["li","5. The person who's quick and correct is entitled to get a point for his team.","5. 又快又正确的人可以为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["li","(2) Review the last class using digital teaching. Have the students look at the touchscreen all-in-one and repeat the sentences.","(2) 用数字教学复习上一堂课，请学生看触控一体机并复诵句子。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers Lesson 8:Are You Ready? (15 mins)","Classroom Readers 第 8 课 Are You Ready? 准备好了吗？（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) Show the situation that will be taught today on the monitor.","(1) 在屏幕上展示今天要教的情境。",0],["li","(2) Now introduce the vocabulary.","(2) 接着介绍单词。",0],["d","test. Everybody, say \"test\"","T",0],["d","test.","S",0],["li","(3) Write the vocabulary on the board and spell it phonetically.","(3) 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读拼出来。",0],["d","e, e, e, / e /,/ e /,/ e / T, t, t /t/, /t/, /t/ s, s,s /s/,/s/,/s/ test, /test/","T",0],["li","(4) Keep introducing the vocabulary by pointing to the monitor and have the students repeat after you.","(4) 继续指着屏幕介绍单词，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(5) Press \"NEXT,\" and have the students repeat after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(5) 按“NEXT”，请学生跟着触控一体机复诵。",0],["li","(6) Open book: Have the students open Classroom Readers to page 20 and let the students practice reading individually.","(6) 打开课本：请学生打开 Classroom Readers 第 20 页，让学生个别练习朗读。",0],["li","(7) Q & A: See \"Classroom Readers\" page 23. Ask the students some questions using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(7) 问与答：请看 Classroom Readers 第 23 页，用触控一体机问学生一些问题。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 15: Are You Ready? (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 15 课 Are You Ready? 准备好了吗？（25 mins）",0],["h2","15.1",null,0],["li","(1) Use the touchscreen all-in-one to teach today's lesson.","(1) 用触控一体机教今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Let the students repeat the vocabulary after the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请学生跟着触控一体机复诵单词。",0],["li","(3) Point to the picture and tell the students about the situation. T (points to the old man and the woman): They are old.","(3) 指着图片，告诉学生图中的情境。T（指着老先生和女士）：They are old.",0],["d","Are they old?","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are old.","Ss",0],["p","Follow this style and teach the students feelings and adjectives. Then have the students make sentences using second and third person plurals. For example:","用这种方式教学生各种感受和形容词，再请学生用第二、第三人称复数造句。例如：",0],["p","Write a sentence on the board: He is young. (Show the picture of \"young\" in the touchscreen all-in-one.) Then erase \"young.\" Show the picture of \"old\" in the touchscreen all-in-one, and have the students say, \"He is old.\"","在黑板上写一个句子：He is young.（在触控一体机上展示“young”的图片）再擦掉“young”，在触控一体机上展示“old”的图片，请学生说 \"He is old.\"",0],["h3","True or False Chairs.","是非椅子游戏",0],["li","1. Have some copies of the following flashcards: hungry, thirsty, hot, cold, full, old, young, angry, sad, bad.","1. 准备以下单词卡数张：hungry、thirsty、hot、cold、full、old、young、angry、sad、bad。",0],["li","2. Divide and mark the floor into \"True\" and \"False\" side. Have the students stand in the middle of the classroom.","2. 把地板分成“True”和“False”两边，请学生站在教室中间。",0],["li","3. Hold up a flashcard and use today's sentence patterns for the game. Cover up the words at the bottom of the card when holding up the card. Say a word that describes the card. If it's true, they have to go to \" True\" side and vice versa. If they go to the wrong side, they have to go back to their seats.","3. 举起一张单词卡，用今天的句型进行游戏。举卡时遮住卡片下方的字，说出一个描述这张卡的字。如果是对的，学生要走到“True”那一边，反之亦然。走错边的人要回到座位。",0],["li","(4) Open Book: Have the students open their books and repeat the vocabulary after you.","(4) 打开课本：请学生打开课本，跟着您复诵单词。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson 15: Are You Ready? (25 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 15 课 Are You Ready? 准备好了吗？（25 mins）",0],["h2","15.2 -A",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 15.2-A and have the students listen to the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 进入 15.2-A 页，请学生听触控一体机。",0],["li","(2) Take out Activity Sheet 7:","(2) 拿出活动单 7：",0],["p","Have the students make \" \" in the squares to describe someone's feelings. Let the students make the sentences according to the chart they made and say the sentences to one of their classmates. The students have to draw the faces in the squares below according to what they heard from their partner.","请学生在方格中打记号，描述某人的感受，再依照自己做的表格造句，并说给一位同学听。学生要依照从搭档那里听到的内容，在下面的方格画出表情。",0],["li","(3) After finishing the Activity Sheet, Teacher points to each picture in 15.2 in the com puter and ask students questions. T (Points to picture 1 and himself): Are we happy?","(3) 完成活动单后，老师指着触控一体机 15.2 中的每张图片问学生问题。T（指着第 1 张图和自己）：Are we happy?",0],["d","Yes, you are. You are happy.","Ss",0],["h2","15.2 -B",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 15.2-B in the touchscreen all-in-one. Have the students try to make questions orally according to the answers.","(1) 进入触控一体机的 15.2-B 页，请学生试着依照答案用口语提出问句。",0],["li","(2) Divide the students into six groups and have each group take turns typing the questions into the touchscreen all-in-one. Help the students finish the questions. Pay attention to the time that students spend and the accuracy of their questions.","(2) 把学生分成六组，每组轮流在触控一体机上输入问句。协助学生完成问句，并注意学生花的时间和问句的正确性。",0],["li","(3) The group that finishes quickly and correctly will win a point.","(3) 又快又正确完成的组别得一分。",0],["li","(4) Open Book: Have the students open their Classroom Activities to page 39 and 40 and read along.","(4) 打开课本：请学生打开 Classroom Activities 第 39、40 页一起朗读。",0],["h2","15.3",null,0],["li","(1) Enter page 15.3 in the touchscreen all-in-one. Have the students repeat after you.","(1) 进入触控一体机的 15.3 页，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(2) Be aware of students' \"es\" sound. You can have them pronounce individually.","(2) 注意学生“es”的发音，可以请他们个别念。",0],["li","(3) Turn off the sound, pick some students to look at the pictures and pronounce them. Now turn on the sound after each practice to check the pronunciation.","(3) 关掉声音，挑几位学生看图片念出单词，每次练习后再打开声音检查发音。",0],["h2","15.4",null,0],["li","(1) Write some words on page 41 to review final \"s\" and \"es\" sounds.","(1) 写出第 41 页的一些单词，复习词尾“s”和“es”的音。",0],["li","(2) Let the students go to 15.4 in Classroom Activities (page 41) and listen to the touchscreen all-in-one while the screen is covered.","(2) 请学生翻到 Classroom Activities 的 15.4（第 41 页），遮住屏幕听触控一体机念。",0],["li","(3) Play the touchscreen all-in-one again and let the students check their answers. In the meantime, ask students to repeat the words only with \"es\" sound.","(3) 再播放一次触控一体机，让学生核对答案，同时请学生只复诵有“es”音的单词。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, teachers need to read the dialog to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the dialog script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念对话给学生听（对话稿请参考附录）；第 2 题则播放 MP3 给全班听。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and label with the number 1, 2, or 3","(1) 听一听，标上数字 1、2 或 3",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the dialog to the students and have them listen to you and do the exercise. (Teachers can read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念对话给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(3) Listen and check the pictures using \"V\" or \"X\"","(3) 听一听，用“V”或“X”勾选图片",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monologue. (See below). Monolog Of Let's Check What a wonderful time to visit a friend's home. What will you bring when you visit your friend? Please turn to page 50, Let's Check. Listen and check the pictures using a check or an x. Let's practice the words together.","播放独白（如下）。Let's Check 独白：What a wonderful time to visit a friend's home. What will you bring when you visit your friend? Please turn to page 50, Let's Check. Listen and check the pictures using a check or an x. Let's practice the words together.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h3","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so that they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h3","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 14"]],[34,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids"]],[34,["儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Class 8"]],[46,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 15","15.1","15.1","15.2 A/B","15.3","15.4"]],[101,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Are You Ready?"],"bd":"","m":100},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[80,81],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R/C.A Review","C.R./C.A. 复习",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","Asking permission to be let in Asking for identities Expressing welcome Extending invitations to others to enter","请求别人让自己进去；询问身份；表示欢迎；邀请别人进来",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","flashcards, the digital equipment","单词卡、数字教学设备",0],["h3","EEC 1 Lesson 12","EEC 1 第 12 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","purse, socks, shorts, skirt",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","[knock/ knock/ knock]","A",0],["d","Who's there?","B",0],["d","It's Bob and Mary","A",0],["d","Hello, there. Come in.","B",0],["h2","Review (10 mins)","复习 Review（10 mins）",0],["p","Have a copy of the quiz and go over it with the class. Drill your students with sample questions. Review sentence patterns, vocabulary and phonics. Use the digital teaching and flashcards to reinforce the lessons that the students have learned.","拿一份小测验卷和全班一起复习，用范例题目反复练习，复习句型、单词和发音。用数字教学和单词卡加强学生学过的课程。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put away any unnecessary material before starting the test. Then, hands out the quizzes. The quiz is designed to prepare them for the test. Make sure they keep quiet. If they finish early, have them sit at their desks or quietly leave the room.","开始考试前，请学生把不需要的东西收起来，再发下考卷。这次小测验是为了帮学生准备测验。确认学生保持安静。提早写完的学生可以坐在座位上，或安静地离开教室。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (20 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（20 mins）",0],["p","Get the students prepared for the listening quiz. Quickly review the questions on the paper. Play the tape only once or twice according to the comprehension of the students. Give them enough time to write their answers.","让学生准备听力小测验，快速复习考卷上的题目。依照学生的理解程度，录音带只播一到两次，给学生足够的时间写答案。",0],["h2","Final Test Review and Graduation Preparation (15 mins)","期末测验复习与结业准备（15 mins）",0],["li","(1) Use the remaining time to review for the final test. Use games and activities that would reinforce the test. Have a copy of the test. Don't give answers directly from the test, but change the questions a little bit.","(1) 利用剩下的时间为期末测验做复习，用能加强测验内容的游戏和活动。拿一份测验卷，但不要直接给考卷上的答案，而是把题目稍微改一下。",0],["li","(2) Also, take some time to rehearse for the graduation ceremony. There is a complete script in class of this manual.","(2) 也花点时间排练结业典礼，本手册中有完整的剧本。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为快速复习。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What can I do?\" and let them check the appropriate box. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生在适当的方格打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group do a mini role-play of the dialog in the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and teachers need to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers forf \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write \"quiz\" on the board and have the students write it down in their progress reports.","(1) 在黑板上写“quiz”，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and give each student some written comments or encouragement. Also, it is a good time to give the students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 11","电话教学教材 11",0],["li","1. Review Readers L.7-L.8 Practice the dialogues with your student.","1. 复习读本第 7–8 课，和学生练习对话。",0],["li","2. T: How old are you?",null,0],["d","I am years old.","S",0],["li","3. T: Are you young?",null,0],["d","Yes, I am young.","S",0],["li","4. T: Are you tall?",null,0],["d","Yes, I am tall.","S",0],["p","No, I not am tall. I am short.","（错误示范）No, I not am tall. I am short.",0],["li","5. T: Are you Chinese?",null,0],["d","Yes, I am Chinese.","S",0]],"g":[[15,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4-Lesson 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11-Lesson 15"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":100},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[82],"b":[["h2","Test Day 3","测验日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","Review Classroom Readers Lesson 4- Lesson 8 Review Classroom Activities Lesson 11- Lesson 15 Test","复习 Classroom Readers 第 4–8 课；复习 Classroom Activities 第 11–15 课；测验",0],["h2","Review (15 mins)","复习 Review（15 mins）",0],["p","Take ten minutes to review for the test. Review the vocabulary and sentences by repeating after the touchscreen all-in-one according to the \"Digital Teaching Guide\" Have the students repeat the sentences one time and then try to spell the vocabulary or answer the questions which are related to the sentences.","花十分钟为测验做复习。依照“数字教学路径”跟着触控一体机复诵单词和句子。请学生把句子念一遍，再试着拼出单词或回答与句子相关的问题。",0],["h2","The Test (40 mins)","测验 The Test（40 mins）",0],["p","Have the students put away any unnecessary material away before starting the test Then, hand out the test paper. The test will probably take the entire class. If the students finish early, have them prepare for the oral test","开始考试前，请学生把不需要的东西收起来，再发下考卷。测验大概会用掉整堂课；如果学生提早写完，请他们准备口语测验。",0],["h2","Oral Test (35 mins)","口语测验 Oral Test（35 mins）",0],["p","Conduct the oral test outside the classroom, individually, with the students. Each question is worth four points; one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation, and fluency. Give the students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor the student's behavior while you are out of the classroom or position yourself so you can observe the class through a window. The oral test is worth 20% of the test total. Bring a blank tape to the oral test and record the oral test. Listen to the tape later to know where the student needs help. 1.Is she a teacher?(No,) 4%(T: Listen to the answers and make questions. )","在教室外个别进行口语测验，每题四分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各一分。先给学生改正自己错误的机会。您不在教室时，指定一位班长维持秩序，或站在可以从窗外观察班级的位置。口语测验占总成绩的 20%。准备一卷空白录音带录下口语测验，之后再听一次，了解学生需要加强哪些部分。1. Is she a teacher? (No,) 4%（T：听答案，说出问句。）",0],["h3","2. T: No, we are not. We are angry. 4%",null,0],["h3","(T: Listen to the answers and make questions. )","（T：听答案，说出问句。）",0],["h3","3. T: No, you are not. You are old. 4%",null,0],["h3","(T: Listen to the answers and make questions. )","（T：听答案，说出问句。）",0],["h3","4. Are you American? 4%",null,0],["h3","5. Are you hungry? 4%",null,0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write \"test\" on the board and have the students write it down in their progress report books.","(1) 在黑板上写“test”，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some written comments or encouragement. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[3,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","儿童进阶","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4- Lesson 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11-Lesson 15"]],[15,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":100},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[83,84,85],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 3","活动日 3",0],["h3","Goal","目标",0],["p","To do a Field Trip To correct Test 3 To prepare for PTA Night","进行校外活动；订正测验 3；准备家长之夜",0],["h2","Test Review(15 mins)","讲评测验 Test Review（15 mins）",0],["p","Go over the test with the students, pointing out and correcting any mistakes they have made.","和学生一起讲评测验，指出并订正他们的错误。",0],["h2","PTA Preparation (30 mins)","家长活动准备 PTA Preparation（30 mins）",0],["h3","PTA Preparation","家长活动准备",0],["p","This is the big day! Take this time to rehearse for the graduation ceremony. Here's the format for the actual ceremony. 1.Song. Start out by having the students sing a song. Any song that they have learned would be fine. Have the students sing the song first, then teach the song to the parents. Get everyone involved. 2.Game/Competition. Volleyball would be a good game to play during this part. Divide the students and their parents into two teams. Make a paper ball. Give it to one side of the class. The person who has the ball asks a question using a sentence pattern that they've learned, and throws the ball to the other team. Somebody has to catch it. Whoever catches the ball has to answer the question and ask another question, throwing the ball to the other side of the room.","今天是大日子！利用这段时间排练结业典礼。正式典礼的流程如下：1. 唱歌：先请学生唱一首歌，任何学过的歌都可以。学生先唱，再教家长唱，让大家都参与。2. 游戏／比赛：这部分很适合玩排球游戏。把学生和家长分成两队，做一颗纸球交给其中一边。拿到球的人用学过的句型问一个问题，再把球丢给另一队，一定要有人接住。接到球的人要回答问题，再问另一个问题，把球丢回另一边。",0],["li","3. Role Play. This will be the most challenging, but it will be the most fun. Basically, this part will be a series of short skits. This part will be entertaining for the parents, and it's a chance for the students to speak English. Below is the script for the role plays.","3. 角色扮演：这部分最有挑战性，但也最有趣，基本上是一系列短剧。这个部分能让家长看得开心，也是学生说英语的好机会。以下是角色扮演的剧本。",0],["h2","Play: The First Day of School (30 mins)","短剧：开学第一天（30 mins）",0],["h3","The First Day of School","开学第一天",0],["p","Cast of Characters: Ms. Brown, Katie, Kai, Sam, Charlie (It's the first day of school. Everybody is a new student. The class hasn't started yet. Sam and Kai are standing around the classroom.)","角色：Ms. Brown、Katie、Kai、Sam、Charlie。（今天是开学第一天，大家都是新同学，还没开始上课，Sam 和 Kai 站在教室里。）",0],["d","Hello, I am Sam. What's your name?","Sam",0],["d","Hello, my name is Kai.","Kai",0],["d","Are you a new student?","Sam",0],["d","Yes, I am. I am a new student. Are you a new student, too?","Kai",0],["d","Yes, I am. I am a new student, too.","Sam",0],["p","(Charlie enters the room)","（Charlie 走进教室）",0],["d","He is Charlie. He is a student, too.","Sam",0],["d","My name is Charlie. What's your name?","Charlie",0],["d","My name is Kai. Is this a classroom?","Kai",0],["d","Yes, this is a classroom.","Charlie",0],["p","(Ms. Brown)","（Ms. Brown）",0],["d","Is she a teacher?","Kai",0],["d","Yes, she is a teacher. She is Ms. Brown.","Sam",0],["p","Ms. Brown: Good morning Sam. Good morning Charlie. (pointing to Kai) What is your name?",null,0],["d","My name is Kai. I am a new student.","Kai",0],["p","Ms. Brown: My name is Ms. Brown. I am your teacher. Please sit down. (Everyone sits down. Kim and Katie enter the class and sit down.) Ms. Brown: Good morning girls. What are your names?","Ms. Brown: My name is Ms. Brown. I am your teacher. Please sit down.（大家都坐下。Kim 和 Katie 走进教室坐下。）Ms. Brown: Good morning girls. What are your names?",0],["d","My name is Kim. I am a new student.","Kim",0],["d","My name is Katie. I am a new student, too.","Katie",0],["p","Ms. Brown: Welcome! He is Charlie. He is Kai. He is Sam. They are your classmates.",null,0],["d","Hello. We are happy to meet you.","Everyone",0],["h3","At the Playground","在游乐场",0],["p","Cast of Characters: Sam, Katie, Kim, Kai, Charlie, (Everyone is outside playing in the playground) (Props: slide, kite, doll, yo-yo, balls, see-saw)","角色：Sam、Katie、Kim、Kai、Charlie。（大家都在外面的游乐场玩。）（道具：滑梯、风筝、洋娃娃、溜溜球、球、跷跷板）",0],["d","What is this?","Kai",0],["d","This is a slide.","Sam",0],["d","Look! A kite!","Charlie",0],["d","What color is it?","Kai",0],["d","It is blue. It is a blue kite.","Charlie",0],["d","What is that?","Katie",0],["d","It is a slide.","Sam",0],["d","Is it small?","Kim",0],["d","Yes, it is, It is a small slide.","Charlie",0],["d","(pointing to the balls) How many balls?","Kai",0],["d","I can count 3 balls.","Kim",0],["d","Are they big?","Charlie",0],["d","No, they are not big. They are small balls.","Katie",0],["d","(Looking at Kai and Charlie) We are friends.","Sam",0],["d","Yes, we are friends.","Charlie",0],["d","Are we happy?","Kai",0],["d","Yes, we are happy!","Sam",0],["h2","The Graduation Ceremony (15 mins)","结业典礼 The Graduation Ceremony（15 mins）",0],["p","Have the students move to the graduation area in an orderly fashion. Run through the games and activities mentioned above. After they've finished the activities, it's time for the awards ceremony. Have the students come to the front to receive their award and certificate. Be sure to shake their hand and congratulate them. After the ceremony, spend some time talking to the parents. Answer any questions the parents have.","请学生有秩序地移动到典礼场地，进行上面提到的游戏和活动。活动结束后是颁奖典礼，请学生到前面领取奖项和证书，一定要和他们握手并恭喜他们。典礼结束后，花点时间和家长聊聊，回答家长的任何问题。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h3","1-Progress Report Book","1. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and give each student some written comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并给每位学生写一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h3","2-Evaluation Sheet","2. 评估表",0],["li","(1) Have the students open the book to the third evaluation sheet and explain how to use it.","(1) 请学生打开手册翻到第三张评估表，说明使用方法。",0],["li","(2) Have every student repeat each item with you. And try to make them understand the meaning.","(2) 请每位学生跟着您复诵每个项目，并尽量让他们了解意思。",0],["li","(3) And then, ask every student to do it. If they have any questions, help them right away.","(3) 接着请每位学生填写，有任何问题立即协助。",0],["li","(4) Record each student's scores of Quiz, Listening Lab, and Test in the appropriate column.","(4) 在适当的栏记录每位学生的小测验、听力练习和测验分数。",0],["h3","Today's Lesson","今日课程",0],["li","(1) Write \"Parents Teachers Activity Day\" on the board and have the students write it down in their progress reports.","(1) 在黑板上写“Parents Teachers Activity Day”，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress report books individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement about today's performance. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并针对今天的表现给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h3","(3) Telephone Teaching Reminder","(3) 电话教学提醒",0],["p","Have the students write down the time of today's telephone teaching and tell them to stay at home and wait for the call.","请学生写下今天电话教学的时间，并告诉他们在家等电话。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 12","电话教学教材 12",0],["d","Are you tall?","T",0],["d","Yes, I am tall. (No, I am not tall. I am short.)","S",0],["d","Are you thin?","T",0],["d","Yes, I am thin. (No, I am not thin. I am fat.)","S",0],["d","Open your Classroom Activities Book (B) P.36, read number 1.","T",0],["d","They are thirsty.","S",0],["d","Open your Classroom Activities Book (B) P.36, read number 2.","T",0],["d","We are cold..","S",0],["d","Let's count 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ..11","T",0],["d","1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ..11","S",0],["d","Make a sentence with \"they\".","T",0],["d","______________________.","S",0],["d","That's good. Good-bye.","T",0],["d","Bye-bye","S",0]],"g":[[3,["None"]],[53,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answer","k":"img","p":[86,87,88,89,90],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法／发音总整理","t":"Grammar/Phonics Summaries","k":"img","p":[91,92],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check\" Answer","k":"img","p":[93],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];